    "prompt": "A wheel rotates at a constant rate of 2.0 × 10 3 rev / min . (a) What is its angular velocity in radians per second? (b) Through what angle does it turn in 10 s? Express the solution in…",
    "previewHTML": "<p>A wheel rotates at a constant rate of <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>2.0</mn><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mo>×</mo><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mn>3</mn></msup><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mrow><mrow><mtext>rev</mtext></mrow><mtext>/</mtext><mrow><mtext>min</mtext><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span>. (a) What is its angular velocity in radians per second? (b) Through what angle does it turn in 10 s? Express the solution in radians and degrees.</p>",
    "statementHTML": "<div>\n<p>A wheel rotates at a constant rate of <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>2.0</mn><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mo>×</mo><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mn>3</mn></msup><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mrow><mrow><mtext>rev</mtext></mrow><mtext>/</mtext><mrow><mtext>min</mtext><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span>. (a) What is its angular velocity in radians per second? (b) Through what angle does it turn in 10 s? Express the solution in radians and degrees.</p>\n</div>",
