    "prompt": "Sketch the velocity-versus-time graph from the following position-versus-time graph.",
    "previewHTML": "<p>Sketch the velocity-versus-time graph from the following position-versus-time graph.</p>",
    "statementHTML": "<div>\n<p>Sketch the velocity-versus-time graph from the following position-versus-time graph.</p>\n<span>\n<img alt=\"Graph shows position in meters plotted versus time in seconds. It starts at the origin, reaches 4 meters at 0.4 seconds; decreases to -2 meters at 0.6 seconds, reaches minimum of -6 meters at 1 second, increases to -4 meters at 1.6 seconds, and reaches 2 meters at 2 seconds.\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"textbook-assets/61ffc1fb8a6ebaaaabb1a7d5.jpg\"/>\n</span>\n</div>",
