    "statementHTML": "<div>\n<p>Andrea, a 63.0-kg sprinter, starts a race with an acceleration of <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>4.200</mn><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><msup><mrow><mtext>m/s</mtext></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span>. What is the net external force on her?</p>\n</div>",
