    "category": "problems",
    "topic": "Simple Harmonic Motion",
    "prompt": "Find the frequency of a tuning fork that takes 2.50 × 10 −3 s to complete one oscillation.",
    "previewHTML": "<p>Find the frequency of a tuning fork that takes <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>2.50</mn><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mo>×</mo><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>−3</mn></mrow></msup><mtext>s</mtext></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> to complete one oscillation.</p>",
    "statementHTML": "<div>\n<p>Find the frequency of a tuning fork that takes <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>2.50</mn><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mo>×</mo><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>−3</mn></mrow></msup><mtext>s</mtext></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> to complete one oscillation.</p>\n</div>",
