    "statementHTML": "<div>\n<p>Calculate the voltage applied to a <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>2.00</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mi>μ</mi><mtext>F</mtext></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> capacitor when it holds <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>3.10</mn><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mi>μ</mi><mtext>C</mtext></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> of charge.</p>\n</div>",
