    "category": "problems",
    "topic": "Energy Stored in a Capacitor",
    "prompt": "(a) What is the energy stored in the 10.0 - μ F capacitor of a heart defibrillator charged to 9.00 × 10 3 V ? (b) Find the amount of the stored charge.",
    "previewHTML": "<p>(a) What is the energy stored in the <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>10.0</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mi>μ</mi><mtext>F</mtext></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> capacitor of a heart defibrillator charged to <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>9.00</mn><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mo>×</mo><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mn>3</mn></msup><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mtext>V</mtext></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span>\n? (b) Find the amount of the stored charge.</p>",
    "statementHTML": "<div>\n<p>(a) What is the energy stored in the <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>10.0</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mi>μ</mi><mtext>F</mtext></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> capacitor of a heart defibrillator charged to <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>9.00</mn><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mo>×</mo><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mn>3</mn></msup><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mtext>V</mtext></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span>\n? (b) Find the amount of the stored charge.</p>\n</div>",
    "url": "https://openstax.org/books/university-physics-volume-2/pages/8-problems#fs-id1167132529025",
    "solutionUrl": "https://openstax.org/books/university-physics-volume-2/pages/chapter-8#fs-id1167132529025-solution",
    "solutionHTML": "<div>\n<p>a. 405 J; b. 90.0 mC</p>\n</div>",
    "attributionHTML": "OpenStax, <em>University Physics Volume 2</em>, Chapter 8, Problem 43. Authors: William Moebs, Samuel J. Ling, and Jeff Sanny. <a href=\"https://openstax.org/books/university-physics-volume-2/pages/8-problems#fs-id1167132529025\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Access for free at OpenStax</a>. Content © Rice University, licensed <a href=\"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">CC BY-NC-SA 4.0</a>. Formatting adapted for this noncommercial local study app."
