    "previewHTML": "<p><strong>Unreasonable results.</strong> A particle moves along the <em>x</em>-axis according to <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>t</mi><mtext>​</mtext></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span>. At what time is the velocity of the particle equal to zero? Is this reasonable?</p>",
    "statementHTML": "<div>\n<p><strong>Unreasonable results.</strong> A particle moves along the <em>x</em>-axis according to <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>t</mi><mtext>​</mtext></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span>. At what time is the velocity of the particle equal to zero? Is this reasonable?</p>\n</div>",
