    "number": 34,
    "category": "problems",
    "topic": "Rotational Variables",
    "prompt": "A gyroscope slows from an initial rate of 32.0 rad/s at a rate of 0.700 rad/s 2 . How long does it take to come to rest?",
    "previewHTML": "<p>A gyroscope slows from an initial rate of 32.0 rad/s at a rate of <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>0.700</mn><msup><mrow><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mtext>rad/s</mtext></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span>. How long does it take to come to rest?</p>",
    "statementHTML": "<div>\n<p>A gyroscope slows from an initial rate of 32.0 rad/s at a rate of <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>0.700</mn><msup><mrow><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mtext>rad/s</mtext></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span>. How long does it take to come to rest?</p>\n</div>",
    "url": "https://openstax.org/books/university-physics-volume-1/pages/10-problems#fs-id1167134533813",
    "attributionHTML": "OpenStax, <em>University Physics Volume 1</em>, Chapter 10, Problem 34. Authors: William Moebs, Samuel J. Ling, and Jeff Sanny. <a href=\"https://openstax.org/books/university-physics-volume-1/pages/10-problems#fs-id1167134533813\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Access for free at OpenStax</a>. Content © Rice University, licensed <a href=\"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">CC BY-NC-SA 4.0</a>. Formatting adapted for this noncommercial local study app."
