    "statementHTML": "<div>\n<p>A stroboscope is set to flash every <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>8.00</mn><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mo>×</mo><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>−5</mn></mrow></msup><mtext>s</mtext></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span>. What is the frequency of the flashes?</p>\n</div>",
