    "topic": "Work and energy",
    "prompt": "Constant power P is delivered to a car of mass m by its engine. Show that if air resistance can be ignored, the distance covered in a time t by the car, starting from rest, is given by s…",
    "previewHTML": "<p>Constant power <em>P</em> is delivered to a car of mass <em>m</em> by its engine. Show that if air resistance can be ignored, the distance covered in a time <em>t</em> by the car, starting from rest, is given by <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mn>8</mn><mi>P</mi></mrow><mtext>/</mtext><mrow><mn>9</mn><mi>m</mi></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mtext>/</mtext><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mi>t</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><mtext>/</mtext><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>.</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span></p>",
    "statementHTML": "<div>\n<p>Constant power <em>P</em> is delivered to a car of mass <em>m</em> by its engine. Show that if air resistance can be ignored, the distance covered in a time <em>t</em> by the car, starting from rest, is given by <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mn>8</mn><mi>P</mi></mrow><mtext>/</mtext><mrow><mn>9</mn><mi>m</mi></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mtext>/</mtext><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mi>t</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><mtext>/</mtext><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>.</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span></p>\n</div>",
    "url": "https://openstax.org/books/university-physics-volume-1/pages/7-challenge-problems#fs-id1165037862240",
    "attributionHTML": "OpenStax, <em>University Physics Volume 1</em>, Chapter 7, Problem 106. Authors: William Moebs, Samuel J. Ling, and Jeff Sanny. <a href=\"https://openstax.org/books/university-physics-volume-1/pages/7-challenge-problems#fs-id1165037862240\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Access for free at OpenStax</a>. Content © Rice University, licensed <a href=\"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">CC BY-NC-SA 4.0</a>. Formatting adapted for this noncommercial local study app."
