    "prompt": "Consider a wire of a circular cross-section with a radius of R = 3.00 mm . The magnitude of the current density is modeled as J = c r 2 = 5.00 × 10 6 A m 4 r 2 . What is the current…",
    "previewHTML": "<p>Consider a wire of a circular cross-section with a radius of <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3.00</mn><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mtext>mm</mtext></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span>. The magnitude of the current density is modeled as <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>J</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>c</mi><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>5.00</mn><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mo>×</mo><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mn>6</mn></msup><mfrac><mtext>A</mtext><mrow><msup><mtext>m</mtext><mn>4</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span>. What is the current through the inner section of the wire from the center to <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.5</mn><mi>R</mi></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span>?</p>",
    "statementHTML": "<div>\n<p>Consider a wire of a circular cross-section with a radius of <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3.00</mn><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mtext>mm</mtext></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span>. The magnitude of the current density is modeled as <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>J</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>c</mi><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>5.00</mn><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mo>×</mo><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mn>6</mn></msup><mfrac><mtext>A</mtext><mrow><msup><mtext>m</mtext><mn>4</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span>. What is the current through the inner section of the wire from the center to <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.5</mn><mi>R</mi></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span>?</p>\n</div>",
