    "prompt": "A current of I = 25 A is drawn from a 100-V battery for 30 seconds. By how much is the chemical energy reduced?",
    "previewHTML": "<p>A current of <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>25</mn><mi>A</mi></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> is drawn from a 100-V battery for 30 seconds. By how much is the chemical energy reduced?</p>",
    "statementHTML": "<div>\n<p>A current of <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>25</mn><mi>A</mi></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> is drawn from a 100-V battery for 30 seconds. By how much is the chemical energy reduced?</p>\n</div>",
