    "prompt": "A toy cart is pulled a distance of 6.0 m in a straight line across the floor. The force pulling the cart has a magnitude of 20 N and is directed at 37 ° above the horizontal. What is the…",
    "previewHTML": "<p>A toy cart is pulled a distance of 6.0 m in a straight line across the floor. The force pulling the cart has a magnitude of 20 N and is directed at <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>37</mn><mtext>°</mtext></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> above the horizontal. What is the work done by this force?</p>",
    "statementHTML": "<div>\n<p>A toy cart is pulled a distance of 6.0 m in a straight line across the floor. The force pulling the cart has a magnitude of 20 N and is directed at <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>37</mn><mtext>°</mtext></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> above the horizontal. What is the work done by this force?</p>\n</div>",
