    "statementHTML": "<div>\n<p>A particle of charge <em>q</em> and mass <em>m</em> is accelerated from rest through a potential difference <em>V</em>, after which it encounters a uniform magnetic field <em>B</em>. If the particle moves in a plane perpendicular to <em>B</em>, what is the radius of its circular orbit?</p>\n</div>",
