    "prompt": "An 80.0-kg passenger in an SUV traveling at 1.00 × 10 2 km/h is wearing a seat belt. The driver slams on the brakes and the SUV stops in 45.0 m. Find the force of the seat belt on the…",
    "previewHTML": "<p>An 80.0-kg passenger in an SUV traveling at <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>1.00</mn><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mo>×</mo><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> km/h is wearing a seat belt. The driver slams on the brakes and the SUV stops in 45.0 m. Find the force of the seat belt on the passenger.</p>",
    "statementHTML": "<div>\n<p>An 80.0-kg passenger in an SUV traveling at <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>1.00</mn><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mo>×</mo><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> km/h is wearing a seat belt. The driver slams on the brakes and the SUV stops in 45.0 m. Find the force of the seat belt on the passenger.</p></div>",
