    "statementHTML": "<div>\n<p>How much work does the force <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>−2.0</mn><mtext>/</mtext><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mtext>N</mtext></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> do on a particle as it moves from <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2.0</mn><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mtext>m</mtext></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> to <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5.0</mn><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mtext>m?</mtext></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span></p>\n</div>",
