    "prompt": "A man stands on a merry-go-round that is rotating at 2.5 rad/s. If the coefficient of static friction between the man’s shoes and the merry-go-round is μ S = 0.5 , how far from the axis…",
    "previewHTML": "<p>A man stands on a merry-go-round that is rotating at 2.5 rad/s. If the coefficient of static friction between the man’s shoes and the merry-go-round is <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>μ</mi><mtext>S</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0.5</mn></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span>, how far from the axis of rotation can he stand without sliding?</p>",
    "statementHTML": "<div>\n<p>A man stands on a merry-go-round that is rotating at 2.5 rad/s. If the coefficient of static friction between the man’s shoes and the merry-go-round is <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>μ</mi><mtext>S</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0.5</mn></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span>, how far from the axis of rotation can he stand without sliding?</p>\n</div>",
    "url": "https://openstax.org/books/university-physics-volume-1/pages/10-problems#fs-id1167134566767",
    "solutionUrl": "https://openstax.org/books/university-physics-volume-1/pages/chapter-10#fs-id1167134566767-solution",
    "solutionHTML": "<div>\n<p>\n<span><math display=\"inline\">\n<semantics>\n<mrow>\n<mrow>\n<mi>r</mi>\n<mo>=</mo>\n<mn>0.78</mn>\n<mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace>\n<mtext>m</mtext>\n</mrow>\n</mrow>\n\n</semantics>\n</math></span>\n</p>\n</div>",
    "attributionHTML": "OpenStax, <em>University Physics Volume 1</em>, Chapter 10, Problem 47. Authors: William Moebs, Samuel J. Ling, and Jeff Sanny. <a href=\"https://openstax.org/books/university-physics-volume-1/pages/10-problems#fs-id1167134566767\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Access for free at OpenStax</a>. Content © Rice University, licensed <a href=\"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">CC BY-NC-SA 4.0</a>. Formatting adapted for this noncommercial local study app."
