    "statementHTML": "<div>\n<p>What is the direction of the magnetic force on the current in each of the six cases?</p>\n<span>\n<img alt=\"Case a: I is down, B is out of the page. Case b: I is up, B is to the right. Case c: I is to the right, B is into the page. Case d: I is to the left , B is to the right. Case e: I is into the page, B is up. Case f: I is out of the page, B is to the left.\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"textbook-assets/c006c212e972a524f015d7d0.jpg\"/>\n</span>\n</div>",
