    "topic": "Rotation with Constant Angular Acceleration",
    "prompt": "During a 6.0-s time interval, a flywheel with a constant angular acceleration turns through 500 radians and acquires an angular velocity of 100 rad/s. (a) What is the angular velocity at…",
    "previewHTML": "<p>During a 6.0-s time interval, a flywheel with a constant angular acceleration turns through 500 radians and acquires an angular velocity of 100 rad/s. (a) What is the angular velocity at the beginning of the 6.0 s? (b) What is the angular acceleration of the flywheel?</p>",
    "statementHTML": "<div>\n<p>During a 6.0-s time interval, a flywheel with a constant angular acceleration turns through 500 radians and acquires an angular velocity of 100 rad/s. (a) What is the angular velocity at the beginning of the 6.0 s? (b) What is the angular acceleration of the flywheel?</p>\n</div>",
