    "prompt": "What is the angular velocity of a 75.0-cm-diameter tire on an automobile traveling at 90.0 km/h?",
    "previewHTML": "<p>What is the angular velocity of a 75.0-cm-diameter tire on an automobile traveling at 90.0 km/h?</p>",
    "statementHTML": "<div>\n<p>What is the angular velocity of a 75.0-cm-diameter tire on an automobile traveling at 90.0 km/h?</p>\n</div>",
    "url": "https://openstax.org/books/university-physics-volume-1/pages/11-problems#fs-id1165036844835",
    "solutionUrl": "https://openstax.org/books/university-physics-volume-1/pages/chapter-11#fs-id1165036844835-solution",
    "solutionHTML": "<div>\n<p>\n<span><math display=\"inline\">\n<semantics>\n<mrow>\n<mrow>\n<msub>\n<mi>v</mi>\n<mrow>\n<mtext>CM</mtext>\n</mrow>\n</msub>\n<mo>=</mo>\n<mi>R</mi>\n<mi>ω</mi>\n<mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace>\n<mo stretchy=\"false\">⇒</mo>\n<mi>ω</mi>\n<mo>=</mo>\n<mn>66.7</mn>\n<mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace>\n<mtext>rad/s</mtext>\n</mrow>\n</mrow>\n\n</semantics>\n</math></span>\n</p>\n</div>",
    "attributionHTML": "OpenStax, <em>University Physics Volume 1</em>, Chapter 11, Problem 19. Authors: William Moebs, Samuel J. Ling, and Jeff Sanny. <a href=\"https://openstax.org/books/university-physics-volume-1/pages/11-problems#fs-id1165036844835\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Access for free at OpenStax</a>. Content © Rice University, licensed <a href=\"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">CC BY-NC-SA 4.0</a>. Formatting adapted for this noncommercial local study app."
