    "prompt": "Use the definition of potential difference in terms of electric field to deduce the formula for potential difference between r = r a and r = r b for a point charge located at the origin.…",
    "previewHTML": "<p>Use the definition of potential difference in terms of electric field to deduce the formula for potential difference between <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> and <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>b</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> for a point charge located at the origin. Here <em>r</em> is the spherical radial coordinate.</p>",
    "statementHTML": "<div>\n<p>Use the definition of potential difference in terms of electric field to deduce the formula for potential difference between <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> and <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>b</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> for a point charge located at the origin. Here <em>r</em> is the spherical radial coordinate.</p>\n</div>",
