    "topic": "Capacitors and Capacitance",
    "prompt": "A 60.0-pF vacuum capacitor has a plate area of 0.010 m 2 . What is the separation between its plates?",
    "previewHTML": "<p>A 60.0-pF vacuum capacitor has a plate area of <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>0.010</mn><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><msup><mrow><mtext>m</mtext></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span>. What is the separation between its plates?</p>",
    "statementHTML": "<div>\n<p>A 60.0-pF vacuum capacitor has a plate area of <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>0.010</mn><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><msup><mrow><mtext>m</mtext></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span>. What is the separation between its plates?</p>\n</div>",
