    "previewHTML": "<p>Calculate the effective resistance of a pocket calculator that has a 1.35-V battery and through which 0.200 mA flows.</p>",
    "statementHTML": "<div>\n<p>Calculate the effective resistance of a pocket calculator that has a 1.35-V battery and through which 0.200 mA flows.</p>\n</div>",
