    "prompt": "Protons in an atomic nucleus are typically 10 −15 m apart. What is the electric force of repulsion between nuclear protons?",
    "previewHTML": "<p>Protons in an atomic nucleus are typically <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>−15</mn></mrow></msup><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mtext>m</mtext></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> apart. What is the electric force of repulsion between nuclear protons?</p>",
    "statementHTML": "<div>\n<p>Protons in an atomic nucleus are typically <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>−15</mn></mrow></msup><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mtext>m</mtext></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> apart. What is the electric force of repulsion between nuclear protons?</p>\n</div>",
