    "topic": "Capacitance",
    "prompt": "A parallel-plate capacitor is filled with two dielectrics, as shown below. Show that the capacitance is given by C = 2 ε 0 A d κ 1 κ 2 κ 1 + κ 2 .",
    "previewHTML": "<p>A parallel-plate capacitor is filled with two dielectrics, as shown below. Show that the capacitance is given by</p>",
    "statementHTML": "<div>\n<p>A parallel-plate capacitor is filled with two dielectrics, as shown below. Show that the capacitance is given by</p>\n<p>\n<span><math display=\"inline\">\n<semantics>\n<mrow>\n<mrow>\n<mi>C</mi>\n<mo>=</mo>\n<mn>2</mn>\n<msub>\n<mi>ε</mi>\n<mn>0</mn>\n</msub>\n<mfrac>\n<mi>A</mi>\n<mi>d</mi>\n</mfrac>\n<mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace>\n<mfrac>\n<mrow>\n<msub>\n<mi>κ</mi>\n<mn>1</mn>\n</msub>\n<msub>\n<mi>κ</mi>\n<mn>2</mn>\n</msub>\n</mrow>\n<mrow>\n<msub>\n<mi>κ</mi>\n<mn>1</mn>\n</msub>\n<mo>+</mo>\n<msub>\n<mi>κ</mi>\n<mn>2</mn>\n</msub>\n</mrow>\n</mfrac>\n<mo>.</mo>\n</mrow>\n</mrow>\n</semantics>\n</math></span>\n</p>\n<span>\n<img alt=\"Figure shows two vertical plates of a capacitor. The left half of the area between them is filled with material labeled K1.The right half is filled with material labeled K2. Both K1 and K2 have thickness d by 2. The area of the capacitor plate is labeled A.\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"textbook-assets/90672acaed7d1251fbc5e548.jpg\"/>\n</span>\n</div>",
    "url": "https://openstax.org/books/university-physics-volume-2/pages/8-challenge-problems#fs-id1167131215902",
    "solutionUrl": "https://openstax.org/books/university-physics-volume-2/pages/chapter-8#fs-id1167131215902-solution",
    "solutionHTML": "<div>\n<p>proof</p>\n</div>",
    "attributionHTML": "OpenStax, <em>University Physics Volume 2</em>, Chapter 8, Problem 83. Authors: William Moebs, Samuel J. Ling, and Jeff Sanny. <a href=\"https://openstax.org/books/university-physics-volume-2/pages/8-challenge-problems#fs-id1167131215902\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Access for free at OpenStax</a>. Content © Rice University, licensed <a href=\"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">CC BY-NC-SA 4.0</a>. Formatting adapted for this noncommercial local study app."
