    "topic": "Magnetic forces",
    "prompt": "A long-rigid wire lies along the x -axis and carries a current of 2.5 A in the positive x -direction. Around the wire is the magnetic field B → = 2.0 i ^ + 5.0 x 2 j ^ , with x in meters…",
    "previewHTML": "<p>A long-rigid wire lies along the <em>x</em>-axis and carries a current of 2.5 A in the positive <em>x</em>-direction. Around the wire is the magnetic field <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mstyle mathvariant=\"bold\"><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">→</mo></mover></mstyle><mo>=</mo><mn>2.0</mn><mstyle mathvariant=\"bold\"><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mstyle><mo>+</mo><mn>5.0</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mstyle mathvariant=\"bold\"><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mstyle><mo>,</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> with <em>x</em> in meters and <em>B</em> in millitesla. Calculate the magnetic force on the segment of wire between <em>x</em> = 2.0 m and <em>x</em> = 4.0 m.</p>",
    "statementHTML": "<div>\n<p>A long-rigid wire lies along the <em>x</em>-axis and carries a current of 2.5 A in the positive <em>x</em>-direction. Around the wire is the magnetic field <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mstyle mathvariant=\"bold\"><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">→</mo></mover></mstyle><mo>=</mo><mn>2.0</mn><mstyle mathvariant=\"bold\"><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mstyle><mo>+</mo><mn>5.0</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mstyle mathvariant=\"bold\"><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mstyle><mo>,</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> with <em>x</em> in meters and <em>B</em> in millitesla. Calculate the magnetic force on the segment of wire between <em>x</em> = 2.0 m and <em>x</em> = 4.0 m.</p>\n</div>",
