    "previewHTML": "<p>Point charges <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>50</mn><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mi>μ</mi><mtext>C</mtext></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> and <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>−25</mn><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mi>μ</mi><mtext>C</mtext></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> are placed 1.0 m apart. What is the force on a third charge <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>20</mn><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mi>μ</mi><mtext>C</mtext></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> placed midway between <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> and <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span>?</p>",
    "statementHTML": "<div>\n<p>Point charges <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>50</mn><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mi>μ</mi><mtext>C</mtext></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> and <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>−25</mn><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mi>μ</mi><mtext>C</mtext></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> are placed 1.0 m apart. What is the force on a third charge <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>20</mn><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mi>μ</mi><mtext>C</mtext></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> placed midway between <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> and <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span>?</p>\n</div>",
