    "solutionUrl": "https://openstax.org/books/university-physics-volume-2/pages/chapter-5#fs-id1172102137332-solution",
    "solutionHTML": "<div>\n<p>\n<span><math display=\"inline\">\n<semantics>\n<mrow>\n<mrow>\n<mi>F</mi>\n<mo>=</mo>\n<mn>53.94</mn>\n<mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace>\n<mtext>N</mtext>\n</mrow>\n</mrow>\n\n</semantics>\n</math></span>\n</p>\n</div>",
