    "statementHTML": "<div>\n<p>A set of parallel plates has a capacitance of <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>5.0</mn><mtext>µ</mtext><mtext>F</mtext></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span>. How much charge must be added to the plates to increase the potential difference between them by 100 V?</p>\n</div>",
