    "prompt": "How many volts are supplied to operate an indicator light on a DVD player that has a resistance of 140 Ω , given that 25.0 mA passes through it?",
    "previewHTML": "<p>How many volts are supplied to operate an indicator light on a DVD player that has a resistance of <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>140</mn><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mtext>Ω</mtext></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span>, given that 25.0 mA passes through it?</p>",
    "statementHTML": "<div>\n<p>How many volts are supplied to operate an indicator light on a DVD player that has a resistance of <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>140</mn><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mtext>Ω</mtext></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span>, given that 25.0 mA passes through it?</p>\n</div>",
