    "previewHTML": "<p>How far from a <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>1.00</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mi>μ</mi><mtext>C</mtext></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> point charge is the potential 100 V? At what distance is it <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>2.00</mn><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mo>×</mo><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mtext>V?</mtext></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span></p>",
    "statementHTML": "<div>\n<p>How far from a <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>1.00</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mi>μ</mi><mtext>C</mtext></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> point charge is the potential 100 V? At what distance is it <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>2.00</mn><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mo>×</mo><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mtext>V?</mtext></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span></p>\n</div>",
