    "prompt": "A body of mass 2.00 kg is pushed straight upward by a 25.0 N vertical force. What is its acceleration?",
    "previewHTML": "<p>A body of mass 2.00 kg is pushed straight upward by a 25.0 N vertical force. What is its acceleration?</p>",
    "statementHTML": "<div>\n<p>A body of mass 2.00 kg is pushed straight upward by a 25.0 N vertical force. What is its acceleration?</p>\n</div>",
    "url": "https://openstax.org/books/university-physics-volume-1/pages/5-problems#fs-id1165038251129",
    "solutionUrl": "https://openstax.org/books/university-physics-volume-1/pages/chapter-5#fs-id1165038251129-solution",
    "solutionHTML": "<div>\n<p>\n<span><math display=\"inline\">\n<semantics>\n<mrow>\n<mtable>\n<mtr>\n<mtd columnalign=\"right\">\n<mi>w</mi>\n</mtd>\n<mtd columnalign=\"left\">\n<mo>=</mo>\n</mtd>\n<mtd columnalign=\"left\">\n<mn>19.6</mn>\n<mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace>\n<mtext>N</mtext>\n</mtd>\n</mtr>\n<mtr>\n<mtd columnalign=\"right\">\n<msub>\n<mi>F</mi>\n<mrow>\n<mtext>net</mtext>\n</mrow>\n</msub>\n</mtd>\n<mtd columnalign=\"left\">\n<mo>=</mo>\n</mtd>\n<mtd columnalign=\"left\">\n<mn>5.40</mn>\n<mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace>\n<mtext>N</mtext>\n</mtd>\n</mtr>\n<mtr>\n<mtd columnalign=\"right\">\n<msub>\n<mi>F</mi>\n<mrow>\n<mtext>net</mtext>\n</mrow>\n</msub>\n</mtd>\n<mtd columnalign=\"left\">\n<mo>=</mo>\n</mtd>\n<mtd columnalign=\"left\">\n<mi>m</mi>\n<mi>a</mi>\n<mo stretchy=\"false\">⇒</mo>\n<mi>a</mi>\n<mo>=</mo>\n<mn>2.70</mn>\n<mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace>\n<msup>\n<mtext>m/s</mtext>\n<mn>2</mn>\n</msup>\n</mtd>\n</mtr>\n</mtable>\n</mrow>\n\n</semantics>\n</math></span>\n</p>\n</div>",
    "attributionHTML": "OpenStax, <em>University Physics Volume 1</em>, Chapter 5, Problem 45. Authors: William Moebs, Samuel J. Ling, and Jeff Sanny. <a href=\"https://openstax.org/books/university-physics-volume-1/pages/5-problems#fs-id1165038251129\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Access for free at OpenStax</a>. Content © Rice University, licensed <a href=\"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">CC BY-NC-SA 4.0</a>. Formatting adapted for this noncommercial local study app."
