    "prompt": "The current in a long solenoid with 20 turns per centimeter of radius 3 cm is varied with time at a rate of 2 A/s. A circular loop of wire of radius 5 cm and resistance 2 Ω surrounds the…",
    "previewHTML": "<p>The current in a long solenoid with 20 turns per centimeter of radius 3 cm is varied with time at a rate of 2 A/s. A circular loop of wire of radius 5 cm and resistance <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mtext>Ω</mtext></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> surrounds the solenoid. Find the electrical current induced in the loop.</p>",
    "statementHTML": "<div>\n<p>The current in a long solenoid with 20 turns per centimeter of radius 3 cm is varied with time at a rate of 2 A/s. A circular loop of wire of radius 5 cm and resistance <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mtext>Ω</mtext></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> surrounds the solenoid. Find the electrical current induced in the loop.</p></div>",
