    "statementHTML": "<div>\n<p>A commuter backs her car out of her garage with an acceleration of 1.40 m/s<sup>2</sup>. (a) How long does it take her to reach a speed of 2.00 m/s? (b) If she then brakes to a stop in 0.800 s, what is her acceleration?</p>\n</div>",
