    "statementHTML": "<div>\n<p>Find the current through a loop needed to create a maximum torque of <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>9.0</mn><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mtext>N</mtext><mo>·</mo><mtext>m</mtext><mo>.</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> The loop has 50 square turns that are 15.0 cm on a side and is in a uniform 0.800-T magnetic field.</p>\n</div>",
