    "previewHTML": "<p>Two point charges, <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2.0</mn><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mo>×</mo><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>−7</mn></mrow></msup><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mtext>C</mtext></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> and <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>−6.0</mn><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mo>×</mo><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>−8</mn></mrow></msup><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mtext>C</mtext><mo>,</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> are held 25.0 cm apart. (a) What is the electric field at a point 5.0 cm from the negative charge and along the line between the two charges? (b)What is the force on an electron placed at that point?</p>",
    "statementHTML": "<div>\n<p>Two point charges, <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2.0</mn><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mo>×</mo><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>−7</mn></mrow></msup><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mtext>C</mtext></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> and <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>−6.0</mn><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mo>×</mo><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>−8</mn></mrow></msup><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mtext>C</mtext><mo>,</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> are held 25.0 cm apart. (a) What is the electric field at a point 5.0 cm from the negative charge and along the line between the two charges? (b)What is the force on an electron placed at that point?</p>\n</div>",
