    "solutionHTML": "<div>\n<p>a. <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>N</mi><mi>I</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>,</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> so <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi></mrow></semantics></math></span> decreases by 5.00% if <em>B</em> decreases by 5.00%; b. 5.26% increase</p>\n</div>",
