    "prompt": "A bullet in a gun is accelerated from the firing chamber to the end of the barrel at an average rate of 6.20 × 10 5 m/s 2 for 8.10 × 10 − 4 s . What is its muzzle velocity (that is, its…",
    "previewHTML": "<p>A bullet in a gun is accelerated from the firing chamber to the end of the barrel at an average rate of <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>6.20</mn><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mo>×</mo><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mn>5</mn></msup><msup><mrow><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mtext>m/s</mtext></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> for <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>8.10</mn><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mo>×</mo><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mtext>−</mtext><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mtext>s</mtext></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span>. What is its muzzle velocity (that is, its final velocity)?</p>",
    "statementHTML": "<div>\n<p>A bullet in a gun is accelerated from the firing chamber to the end of the barrel at an average rate of <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>6.20</mn><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mo>×</mo><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mn>5</mn></msup><msup><mrow><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mtext>m/s</mtext></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> for <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>8.10</mn><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mo>×</mo><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mtext>−</mtext><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mtext>s</mtext></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span>. What is its muzzle velocity (that is, its final velocity)?</p>\n</div>",
    "url": "https://openstax.org/books/university-physics-volume-1/pages/3-problems#fs-id1168329484654",
    "solutionUrl": "https://openstax.org/books/university-physics-volume-1/pages/chapter-3#fs-id1168329484654-solution",
    "solutionHTML": "<div>\n<p>\n<span><math display=\"inline\">\n<semantics>\n<mrow>\n<mrow>\n<mi>v</mi>\n<mo>=</mo>\n<mn>502.20</mn>\n<mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace>\n<mrow>\n<mtext>m/s</mtext>\n</mrow>\n</mrow>\n</mrow>\n\n</semantics>\n</math></span>\n</p>\n</div>",
