    "statementHTML": "<div>\n<p>What is the net electric force on the charge located at the lower right-hand corner of the triangle shown here?</p>\n<span>\n<img alt=\"Charges are shown at the vertices of an equilateral triangle with sides length a. The bottom of the triangle is on the x axis of an x y coordinate system, and the bottom left vertex is at the origin. The charge at the origin is positive q. The charge at the bottom right hand corner is also positive q. The charge at the top vertex is negative two q.\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"textbook-assets/89f7298c436d6a4ff0fcdfcd.jpg\"/>\n</span>\n</div>",
