    "statementHTML": "<div>\n<p>(a) What is the maximum torque on a 150-turn square loop of wire 18.0 cm on a side that carries a 50.0-A current in a 1.60-T field? (b) What is the torque when <em>θ</em> is 10.9º?</p>\n</div>",
