    "statementHTML": "<div>\n<p>A lead rod has a length of 30.00 cm and a resistance of <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>5.00</mn><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mi>μ</mi><mtext>Ω</mtext></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span>. What is the radius of the rod?</p>\n</div>",
