    "statementHTML": "<div>\n<p>A firefighter has mass <em>m</em>; they hear the fire alarm and slides down the pole with acceleration <em>a</em> (which is less than <em>g</em> in magnitude). (a) Write an equation giving the vertical force they must apply to the pole. (b) If their mass is 90.0 kg and they accelerate at <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>5.00</mn><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><msup><mrow><mtext>m/s</mtext></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>,</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> what is the magnitude of their applied force?</p>\n</div>",
