    "topic": "Center of Mass",
    "prompt": "Find the center of mass of a rectangular block of length a and width b that has a nonuniform density such that when the rectangle is placed in the x , y -plane with one corner at the…",
    "previewHTML": "<p>Find the center of mass of a rectangular block of length <em>a</em> and width <em>b</em> that has a nonuniform density such that when the rectangle is placed in the <em>x</em>,<em>y</em>-plane with one corner at the origin and the block placed in the first quadrant with the two edges along the <em>x</em>- and <em>y</em>-axes, the density is given by<span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>ρ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>ρ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span>, where <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>ρ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> is a constant.</p>",
    "statementHTML": "<div>\n<p>Find the center of mass of a rectangular block of length <em>a</em> and width <em>b</em> that has a nonuniform density such that when the rectangle is placed in the <em>x</em>,<em>y</em>-plane with one corner at the origin and the block placed in the first quadrant with the two edges along the <em>x</em>- and <em>y</em>-axes, the density is given by<span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>ρ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>ρ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span>, where <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>ρ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> is a constant.</p>\n</div>",
    "url": "https://openstax.org/books/university-physics-volume-1/pages/9-problems#fs-id1167134913627",
    "attributionHTML": "OpenStax, <em>University Physics Volume 1</em>, Chapter 9, Problem 70. Authors: William Moebs, Samuel J. Ling, and Jeff Sanny. <a href=\"https://openstax.org/books/university-physics-volume-1/pages/9-problems#fs-id1167134913627\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Access for free at OpenStax</a>. Content © Rice University, licensed <a href=\"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">CC BY-NC-SA 4.0</a>. Formatting adapted for this noncommercial local study app."
