    "prompt": "The surface charge density on a long straight metallic pipe is σ . What is the electric potential outside and inside the pipe? Assume the pipe has a diameter of 2 a .",
    "previewHTML": "<p>The surface charge density on a long straight metallic pipe is <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>σ</mi></mrow></semantics></math></span>. What is the electric potential outside and inside the pipe? Assume the pipe has a diameter of 2<em>a</em>.</p>",
    "statementHTML": "<div>\n<p>The surface charge density on a long straight metallic pipe is <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>σ</mi></mrow></semantics></math></span>. What is the electric potential outside and inside the pipe? Assume the pipe has a diameter of 2<em>a</em>.</p>\n<span>\n<img alt=\"The figure shows surface charge density on an infinitely long straight metallic pipe.\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"textbook-assets/e785570e7ba884c8ebd7cac3.jpg\"/>\n</span>\n</div>",
