    "prompt": "The cylinder head bolts on a car are to be tightened with a torque of 62.0 N · m . If a mechanic uses a wrench of length 20 cm, what perpendicular force must he exert on the end of the…",
    "previewHTML": "<p>The cylinder head bolts on a car are to be tightened with a torque of 62.0 N<span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mo>·</mo><mtext>m</mtext></mrow></semantics></math></span>. If a mechanic uses a wrench of length 20 cm, what perpendicular force must he exert on the end of the wrench to tighten a bolt correctly?</p>",
    "statementHTML": "<div>\n<p>The cylinder head bolts on a car are to be tightened with a torque of 62.0 N<span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mo>·</mo><mtext>m</mtext></mrow></semantics></math></span>. If a mechanic uses a wrench of length 20 cm, what perpendicular force must he exert on the end of the wrench to tighten a bolt correctly?</p></div>",
