    "prompt": "What is (a) the angular speed and (b) the linear speed of a point on Earth’s surface at latitude 30 ° N. Take the radius of the Earth to be 6309 km. (c) At what latitude would your…",
    "previewHTML": "<p>What is (a) the angular speed and (b) the linear speed of a point on Earth’s surface at latitude <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>30</mn><mtext>°</mtext></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> N. Take the radius of the Earth to be 6309 km. (c) At what latitude would your linear speed be 10 m/s?</p>",
    "statementHTML": "<div>\n<p>What is (a) the angular speed and (b) the linear speed of a point on Earth’s surface at latitude <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>30</mn><mtext>°</mtext></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> N. Take the radius of the Earth to be 6309 km. (c) At what latitude would your linear speed be 10 m/s?</p>\n</div>",
