    "previewHTML": "<p>What current flows through a 2.54-cm-diameter rod of pure silicon that is 20.0 cm long, when <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>1.00</mn><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mo>×</mo><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mn>3</mn></msup><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mtext>V</mtext></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> is applied to it? (Such a rod may be used to make nuclear-particle detectors, for example.)</p>",
    "statementHTML": "<div>\n<p>What current flows through a 2.54-cm-diameter rod of pure silicon that is 20.0 cm long, when <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>1.00</mn><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mo>×</mo><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mn>3</mn></msup><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mtext>V</mtext></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> is applied to it? (Such a rod may be used to make nuclear-particle detectors, for example.)</p>\n</div>",
