    "statementHTML": "<div>\n<p>Two particles of equal mass travel with the same speed in opposite directions along parallel lines separated by a distance <em>d</em>. Show that the angular momentum of this two-particle system is the same no matter what point is used as the reference for calculating the angular momentum.</p>\n</div>",
