    "prompt": "A Hall probe gives a reading of 1.5 μ V for a current of 2 A when it is placed in a magnetic field of 1 T. What is the magnetic field in a region where the reading is 2 μ V for 1.7 A of…",
    "previewHTML": "<p>A Hall probe gives a reading of <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>1.5</mn><mo>μ</mo><mtext>V</mtext></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> for a current of 2 A when it is placed in a magnetic field of 1 T. What is the magnetic field in a region where the reading is <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>μ</mo><mtext>V</mtext></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> for 1.7 A of current?</p>",
    "statementHTML": "<div>\n<p>A Hall probe gives a reading of <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>1.5</mn><mo>μ</mo><mtext>V</mtext></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> for a current of 2 A when it is placed in a magnetic field of 1 T. What is the magnetic field in a region where the reading is <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>μ</mo><mtext>V</mtext></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> for 1.7 A of current?</p>\n</div>",
