    "category": "problems",
    "topic": "Resistivity and Resistance",
    "prompt": "A resistor made of nichrome wire is used in an application where its resistance cannot change more than 1.00% from its value at 20.0 ° C . Over what temperature range can it be used?",
    "previewHTML": "<p>A resistor made of nichrome wire is used in an application where its resistance cannot change more than 1.00% from its value at <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>20.0</mn><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mtext>°</mtext><mtext>C</mtext></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span>. Over what temperature range can it be used?</p>",
    "statementHTML": "<div>\n<p>A resistor made of nichrome wire is used in an application where its resistance cannot change more than 1.00% from its value at <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>20.0</mn><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mtext>°</mtext><mtext>C</mtext></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span>. Over what temperature range can it be used?</p>\n</div>",
