    "prompt": "A 10.00-meter long wire cable that is made of copper has a resistance of 0.051 ohms. (a) What is the weight if the wire was made of copper? (b) What is the weight of a 10.00-meter-long…",
    "previewHTML": "<p>A 10.00-meter long wire cable that is made of copper has a resistance of 0.051 ohms. (a) What is the weight if the wire was made of copper? (b) What is the weight of a 10.00-meter-long wire of the same gauge made of aluminum? (c)What is the resistance of the aluminum wire? The density of copper is <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>8960</mn><msup><mrow><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mtext>kg/m</mtext></mrow><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> and the density of aluminum is <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>2760</mn><msup><mrow><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mtext>kg/m</mtext></mrow><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span>.</p>",
    "statementHTML": "<div>\n<p>A 10.00-meter long wire cable that is made of copper has a resistance of 0.051 ohms. (a) What is the weight if the wire was made of copper? (b) What is the weight of a 10.00-meter-long wire of the same gauge made of aluminum? (c)What is the resistance of the aluminum wire? The density of copper is <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>8960</mn><msup><mrow><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mtext>kg/m</mtext></mrow><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> and the density of aluminum is <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>2760</mn><msup><mrow><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mtext>kg/m</mtext></mrow><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span>.</p>\n</div>",
