    "previewHTML": "<p>The strengths of the fields in the velocity selector of a Bainbridge mass spectrometer are <em>B</em> = 0.500 T and <em>E</em> = <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>1.2</mn><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mo>×</mo><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mn>5</mn></msup><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mtext>V/m</mtext><mo>,</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> and the strength of the magnetic field that separates the ions is <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>B</mi><mi>o</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0.750</mn><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mtext>T</mtext><mo>.</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> A stream of singly charged Li ions is found to bend in a circular arc of radius 2.32 cm. What is the mass of the Li ions?</p>",
    "statementHTML": "<div>\n<p>The strengths of the fields in the velocity selector of a Bainbridge mass spectrometer are <em>B</em> = 0.500 T and <em>E</em> = <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>1.2</mn><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mo>×</mo><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mn>5</mn></msup><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mtext>V/m</mtext><mo>,</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> and the strength of the magnetic field that separates the ions is <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>B</mi><mi>o</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0.750</mn><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mtext>T</mtext><mo>.</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> A stream of singly charged Li ions is found to bend in a circular arc of radius 2.32 cm. What is the mass of the Li ions?</p>\n</div>",
