    "topic": "Torque",
    "prompt": "A simple pendulum consists of a massless tether 50 cm in length connected to a pivot and a small mass of 1.0 kg attached at the other end. What is the torque about the pivot when the…",
    "previewHTML": "<p>A simple pendulum consists of a massless tether 50 cm in length connected to a pivot and a small mass of 1.0 kg attached at the other end. What is the torque about the pivot when the pendulum makes an angle of <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>40</mn><mtext>°</mtext></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> with respect to the vertical?</p>",
    "statementHTML": "<div>\n<p>A simple pendulum consists of a massless tether 50 cm in length connected to a pivot and a small mass of 1.0 kg attached at the other end. What is the torque about the pivot when the pendulum makes an angle of <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>40</mn><mtext>°</mtext></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> with respect to the vertical?</p>\n</div>",
