    "previewHTML": "<p>Which has a larger magnitude of momentum: a 3000-kg elephant moving at 40 km/h or a 60-kg cheetah moving at 112 km/h?</p>",
    "statementHTML": "<div>\n<p>Which has a larger magnitude of momentum: a 3000-kg elephant moving at 40 km/h or a 60-kg cheetah moving at 112 km/h?</p>\n</div>",
    "url": "https://openstax.org/books/university-physics-volume-1/pages/9-additional-problems#fs-id1167133606659",
