    "prompt": "How far apart are two conducting plates that have an electric field strength of 4.50 × 10 3 V/m between them, if their potential difference is 15.0 kV?",
    "previewHTML": "<p>How far apart are two conducting plates that have an electric field strength of <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>4.50</mn><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mo>×</mo><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mn>3</mn></msup><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mtext>V/m</mtext></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> between them, if their potential difference is 15.0 kV?</p>",
