    "category": "problems",
    "topic": "Energy Stored in a Capacitor",
    "prompt": "A capacitor has a charge of 2.5 μ C when connected to a 6.0-V battery. How much energy is stored in this capacitor?",
    "previewHTML": "<p>A capacitor has a charge of <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>2.5</mn><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mtext>μ</mtext><mtext>C</mtext></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> when connected to a 6.0-V battery. How much energy is stored in this capacitor?</p>",
    "statementHTML": "<div>\n<p>A capacitor has a charge of <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>2.5</mn><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mtext>μ</mtext><mtext>C</mtext></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> when connected to a 6.0-V battery. How much energy is stored in this capacitor?</p>\n</div>",
    "url": "https://openstax.org/books/university-physics-volume-2/pages/8-problems#fs-id1167133562879",
    "solutionUrl": "https://openstax.org/books/university-physics-volume-2/pages/chapter-8#fs-id1167133562879-solution",
    "solutionHTML": "<div>\n<p>\n<span><math display=\"inline\">\n<semantics>\n<mrow>\n<mrow>\n<mn>7.5</mn>\n<mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace>\n<mtext>μ</mtext>\n<mtext>J</mtext>\n</mrow>\n</mrow>\n\n</semantics>\n</math></span>\n</p>\n</div>",
    "attributionHTML": "OpenStax, <em>University Physics Volume 2</em>, Chapter 8, Problem 41. Authors: William Moebs, Samuel J. Ling, and Jeff Sanny. <a href=\"https://openstax.org/books/university-physics-volume-2/pages/8-problems#fs-id1167133562879\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Access for free at OpenStax</a>. Content © Rice University, licensed <a href=\"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">CC BY-NC-SA 4.0</a>. Formatting adapted for this noncommercial local study app."
