    "prompt": "A bird flies straight northeast a distance of 95.0 km for 3.0 h. With the x -axis due east and the y -axis due north, what is the displacement in unit vector notation for the bird? What…",
    "previewHTML": "<p>A bird flies straight northeast a distance of 95.0 km for 3.0 h. With the <em>x</em>-axis due east and the <em>y</em>-axis due north, what is the displacement in unit vector notation for the bird? What is the average velocity for the trip?</p>",
