    "previewHTML": "<p>What is the magnetic field at P due to the current <em>I</em> in the wire shown?</p>",
    "statementHTML": "<div>\n<p>What is the magnetic field at P due to the current <em>I</em> in the wire shown?</p>\n<span>\n<img alt=\"This figure shows a current loop consisting of two concentric circular arcs and two parallel radial lines. Outer arc is located at the distance b from the center; inner arc is located at the distance a from the center.\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"textbook-assets/4e6b2eb0322a1bfa58dd34cc.jpg\"/>\n</span>\n</div>",
