    "topic": "Applications of Electrostatics",
    "prompt": "A double charged ion is accelerated to an energy of 32.0 keV by the electric field between two parallel conducting plates separated by 2.00 cm. What is the electric field strength…",
    "previewHTML": "<p>A double charged ion is accelerated to an energy of 32.0 keV by the electric field between two parallel conducting plates separated by 2.00 cm. What is the electric field strength between the plates?</p>",
    "statementHTML": "<div>\n<p>A double charged ion is accelerated to an energy of 32.0 keV by the electric field between two parallel conducting plates separated by 2.00 cm. What is the electric field strength between the plates?</p>\n</div>",
    "url": "https://openstax.org/books/university-physics-volume-2/pages/7-problems#fs-id1167586253351",
    "solutionUrl": "https://openstax.org/books/university-physics-volume-2/pages/chapter-7#fs-id1167586253351-solution",
    "solutionHTML": "<div>\n<p>\n<span><math display=\"inline\">\n<semantics>\n<mrow>\n<mtable>\n<mtr>\n<mtd columnalign=\"left\">\n<msub>\n<mi>K</mi>\n<mtext>f</mtext>\n</msub>\n</mtd>\n<mtd columnalign=\"left\">\n<mo>=</mo>\n</mtd>\n<mtd columnalign=\"left\">\n<mi>q</mi>\n<msub>\n<mi>V</mi>\n<mrow>\n<mtext>AB</mtext>\n</mrow>\n</msub>\n<mo>=</mo>\n<mi>q</mi>\n<mi>E</mi>\n<mi>d</mi>\n<mo stretchy=\"false\">→</mo>\n</mtd>\n</mtr>\n<mtr>\n<mtd columnalign=\"right\">\n<mi>E</mi>\n</mtd>\n<mtd columnalign=\"left\">\n<mo>=</mo>\n</mtd>\n<mtd columnalign=\"left\">\n<mn>8.00</mn>\n<mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace>\n<mo>×</mo>\n<mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace>\n<msup>\n<mn>10</mn>\n<mn>5</mn>\n</msup>\n<mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace>\n<mtext>V/m</mtext>\n</mtd>\n</mtr>\n</mtable>\n</mrow>\n\n</semantics>\n</math></span>\n</p>\n</div>",
    "attributionHTML": "OpenStax, <em>University Physics Volume 2</em>, Chapter 7, Problem 81. Authors: William Moebs, Samuel J. Ling, and Jeff Sanny. <a href=\"https://openstax.org/books/university-physics-volume-2/pages/7-problems#fs-id1167586253351\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Access for free at OpenStax</a>. Content © Rice University, licensed <a href=\"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">CC BY-NC-SA 4.0</a>. Formatting adapted for this noncommercial local study app."
