    "prompt": "A pendulum consists of a rod of mass 1 kg and length 1 m connected to a pivot with a solid sphere attached at the other end with mass 0.5 kg and radius 30 cm. What is the torque about…",
    "previewHTML": "<p>A pendulum consists of a rod of mass 1 kg and length 1 m connected to a pivot with a solid sphere attached at the other end with mass 0.5 kg and radius 30 cm. What is the torque about the pivot when the pendulum makes an angle of <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>30</mn><mtext>°</mtext></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> with respect to the vertical?</p>",
    "statementHTML": "<div>\n<p>A pendulum consists of a rod of mass 1 kg and length 1 m connected to a pivot with a solid sphere attached at the other end with mass 0.5 kg and radius 30 cm. What is the torque about the pivot when the pendulum makes an angle of <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>30</mn><mtext>°</mtext></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> with respect to the vertical?</p>\n</div>",
