    "prompt": "A 165 - μ F capacitor is used in conjunction with a dc motor. How much energy is stored in it when 119 V is applied?",
    "previewHTML": "<p>A <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>165</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mi>μ</mi><mtext>F</mtext></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> capacitor is used in conjunction with a dc motor. How much energy is stored in it when 119 V is applied?</p>",
    "statementHTML": "<div>\n<p>A <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>165</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mi>μ</mi><mtext>F</mtext></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> capacitor is used in conjunction with a dc motor. How much energy is stored in it when 119 V is applied?</p>\n</div>",
    "url": "https://openstax.org/books/university-physics-volume-2/pages/8-problems#fs-id1167133384841",
    "solutionUrl": "https://openstax.org/books/university-physics-volume-2/pages/chapter-8#fs-id1167133384841-solution",
