    "category": "problems",
    "topic": "Torque",
    "prompt": "A torque of 5.00 × 10 3 N · m is required to raise a drawbridge (see the following figure). What is the tension necessary to produce this torque? Would it be easier to raise the…",
    "previewHTML": "<p>A torque of <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>5.00</mn><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mo>×</mo><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mn>3</mn></msup><mtext>N</mtext><mo>·</mo><mtext>m</mtext><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> is required to raise a drawbridge (see the following figure). What is the tension necessary to produce this torque? Would it be easier to raise the drawbridge if the angle <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> were larger or smaller?</p>",
    "statementHTML": "<div>\n<p>A torque of <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>5.00</mn><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mo>×</mo><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mn>3</mn></msup><mtext>N</mtext><mo>·</mo><mtext>m</mtext><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> is required to raise a drawbridge (see the following figure). What is the tension necessary to produce this torque? Would it be easier to raise the drawbridge if the angle <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> were larger or smaller?</p>\n<span>\n<img alt=\"Figure shows the drawbridge that has a length of 6 meters. A force is applied at a 30 degree angle towards the drawbridge.\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"textbook-assets/52c7a1522029601cc135c3d7.jpg\"/>\n</span>\n</div>",
    "url": "https://openstax.org/books/university-physics-volume-1/pages/10-problems#fs-id1167133863010",
    "attributionHTML": "OpenStax, <em>University Physics Volume 1</em>, Chapter 10, Problem 80. Authors: William Moebs, Samuel J. Ling, and Jeff Sanny. <a href=\"https://openstax.org/books/university-physics-volume-1/pages/10-problems#fs-id1167133863010\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Access for free at OpenStax</a>. Content © Rice University, licensed <a href=\"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">CC BY-NC-SA 4.0</a>. Formatting adapted for this noncommercial local study app."
