    "statementHTML": "<div>\n<p>Find the capacitance of a parallel-plate capacitor having plates with a surface area of <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>5.00</mn><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> and separated by 0.100 mm of Teflon™.</p>\n</div>",
