    "previewHTML": "<p>Your 1500-kg sports car accelerates from 0 to 30 m/s in 10 s. What average force is exerted on it during this acceleration?</p>",
    "statementHTML": "<div>\n<p>Your 1500-kg sports car accelerates from 0 to 30 m/s in 10 s. What average force is exerted on it during this acceleration?</p>\n</div>",
