    "topic": "The Biot-Savart Law",
    "prompt": "Two long wires, one of which has a semicircular bend of radius R , are positioned as shown in the accompanying figure. If both wires carry a current I , how far apart must their parallel…",
    "previewHTML": "<p>Two long wires, one of which has a semicircular bend of radius <em>R</em>, are positioned as shown in the accompanying figure. If both wires carry a current <em>I</em>, how far apart must their parallel sections be so that the net magnetic field at P is zero? Does the current in the straight wire flow up or down?</p>",
    "statementHTML": "<div>\n<p>Two long wires, one of which has a semicircular bend of radius <em>R</em>, are positioned as shown in the accompanying figure. If both wires carry a current <em>I</em>, how far apart must their parallel sections be so that the net magnetic field at P is zero? Does the current in the straight wire flow up or down?</p>\n<span>\n<img alt=\"This figure shows two parallel long wires located at a distance a from each other. One of the wires has a semicircular bend of radius R.\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"textbook-assets/05cfee03a435134495d7f223.jpg\"/>\n</span>\n</div>",
    "url": "https://openstax.org/books/university-physics-volume-2/pages/12-problems#fs-id1166167076307",
    "solutionUrl": "https://openstax.org/books/university-physics-volume-2/pages/chapter-12#fs-id1166167076307-solution",
    "solutionHTML": "<div>\n<p><span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>R</mi></mrow><mi>π</mi></mfrac></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span>; the current in the wire to the right must flow up the page.</p>\n</div>",
    "attributionHTML": "OpenStax, <em>University Physics Volume 2</em>, Chapter 12, Problem 21. Authors: William Moebs, Samuel J. Ling, and Jeff Sanny. <a href=\"https://openstax.org/books/university-physics-volume-2/pages/12-problems#fs-id1166167076307\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Access for free at OpenStax</a>. Content © Rice University, licensed <a href=\"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">CC BY-NC-SA 4.0</a>. Formatting adapted for this noncommercial local study app."
