    "prompt": "A solenoid of N 1 turns has length l 1 and radius R 1 , and a second smaller solenoid of N 2 turns has length l 2 and radius R 2 . The smaller solenoid is placed completely inside the…",
    "previewHTML": "<p>A solenoid of <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> turns has length <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>l</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> and radius <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> and a second smaller solenoid of <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> turns has length <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>l</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> and radius <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span>. The smaller solenoid is placed completely inside the larger solenoid so that their long axes coincide. What is the mutual inductance of the two solenoids?</p>",
    "statementHTML": "<div>\n<p>A solenoid of <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> turns has length <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>l</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> and radius <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> and a second smaller solenoid of <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> turns has length <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>l</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> and radius <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span>. The smaller solenoid is placed completely inside the larger solenoid so that their long axes coincide. What is the mutual inductance of the two solenoids?</p>\n</div>",
