    "topic": "Capacitance",
    "prompt": "A parallel-plate capacitor with capacitance 5.0 μ F is charged with a 12.0-V battery, after which the battery is disconnected. Determine the minimum work required to increase the…",
    "previewHTML": "<p>A parallel-plate capacitor with capacitance <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>5.0</mn><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mtext>μ</mtext><mtext>F</mtext></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> is charged with a 12.0-V battery, after which the battery is disconnected. Determine the minimum work required to increase the separation between the plates by a factor of 3.</p>",
    "statementHTML": "<div>\n<p>A parallel-plate capacitor with capacitance <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>5.0</mn><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mtext>μ</mtext><mtext>F</mtext></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> is charged with a 12.0-V battery, after which the battery is disconnected. Determine the minimum work required to increase the separation between the plates by a factor of 3.</p>\n</div>",
