    "previewHTML": "<p>An alpha-particle <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6.64</mn><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mo>×</mo><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>−27</mn></mrow></msup><mtext>kg</mtext><mo>,</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3.2</mn><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mo>×</mo><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>−19</mn></mrow></msup><mtext>C</mtext><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> moving with a velocity <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mstyle mathvariant=\"bold\"><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">→</mo></mover></mstyle><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2.0</mn><mstyle mathvariant=\"bold\"><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mstyle><mo>−</mo><mn>4.0</mn><mstyle mathvariant=\"bold\"><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mstyle><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mo>×</mo><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mn>6</mn></msup><mtext>m/s</mtext></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> enters a region where <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mstyle mathvariant=\"bold\"><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">→</mo></mover></mstyle><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>5.0</mn><mstyle mathvariant=\"bold\"><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mstyle><mo>−</mo><mn>2.0</mn><mstyle mathvariant=\"bold\"><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mstyle><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mo>×</mo><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mn>4</mn></msup><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mtext>V/m</mtext></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> and <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mstyle mathvariant=\"bold\"><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">→</mo></mover></mstyle><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1.0</mn><mstyle mathvariant=\"bold\"><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mstyle><mo>+</mo><mn>4.0</mn><mstyle mathvariant=\"bold\"><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mstyle><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mo>×</mo><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>−2</mn></mrow></msup><mtext>T</mtext><mo>.</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> What is the initial force on it?</p>",
    "statementHTML": "<div>\n<p>An alpha-particle <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6.64</mn><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mo>×</mo><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>−27</mn></mrow></msup><mtext>kg</mtext><mo>,</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3.2</mn><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mo>×</mo><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>−19</mn></mrow></msup><mtext>C</mtext><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> moving with a velocity <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mstyle mathvariant=\"bold\"><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">→</mo></mover></mstyle><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2.0</mn><mstyle mathvariant=\"bold\"><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mstyle><mo>−</mo><mn>4.0</mn><mstyle mathvariant=\"bold\"><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mstyle><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mo>×</mo><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mn>6</mn></msup><mtext>m/s</mtext></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> enters a region where <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mstyle mathvariant=\"bold\"><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">→</mo></mover></mstyle><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>5.0</mn><mstyle mathvariant=\"bold\"><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mstyle><mo>−</mo><mn>2.0</mn><mstyle mathvariant=\"bold\"><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mstyle><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mo>×</mo><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mn>4</mn></msup><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mtext>V/m</mtext></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> and <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mstyle mathvariant=\"bold\"><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">→</mo></mover></mstyle><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1.0</mn><mstyle mathvariant=\"bold\"><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mstyle><mo>+</mo><mn>4.0</mn><mstyle mathvariant=\"bold\"><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mstyle><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mo>×</mo><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>−2</mn></mrow></msup><mtext>T</mtext><mo>.</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> What is the initial force on it?</p>\n</div>",
