    "topic": "Free Fall",
    "prompt": "Calculate the displacement and velocity at times of (a) 0.500 s, (b) 1.00 s, (c) 1.50 s, and (d) 2.00 s for a ball thrown straight up with an initial velocity of 15.0 m/s. Take the point…",
    "previewHTML": "<p>Calculate the displacement and velocity at times of (a) 0.500 s, (b) 1.00 s, (c) 1.50 s, and (d) 2.00 s for a ball thrown straight up with an initial velocity of 15.0 m/s. Take the point of release to be <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span>.</p>",
    "statementHTML": "<div>\n<p>Calculate the displacement and velocity at times of (a) 0.500 s, (b) 1.00 s, (c) 1.50 s, and (d) 2.00 s for a ball thrown straight up with an initial velocity of 15.0 m/s. Take the point of release to be <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span>.</p>\n</div>",
