    "prompt": "Trying to escape his pursuers, a secret agent skis off a slope inclined at 30 ° below the horizontal at 60 km/h. To survive and land on the snow 100 m below, he must clear a gorge 60 m…",
    "previewHTML": "<p>Trying to escape his pursuers, a secret agent skis off a slope inclined at <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>30</mn><mtext>°</mtext></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> below the horizontal at 60 km/h. To survive and land on the snow 100 m below, he must clear a gorge 60 m wide. Does he make it? Ignore air resistance.</p>",
    "statementHTML": "<div>\n<p>Trying to escape his pursuers, a secret agent skis off a slope inclined at <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>30</mn><mtext>°</mtext></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> below the horizontal at 60 km/h. To survive and land on the snow 100 m below, he must clear a gorge 60 m wide. Does he make it? Ignore air resistance.</p>\n<span>\n<img alt=\"A skier is moving with velocity v sub 0 down a slope that is inclined at 30 degrees to the horizontal. The skier is at the edge of a 60 m wide gap. The other side of the gap is 100 m lower.\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"textbook-assets/903ae2fd4b6d67515f53c6cc.jpg\"/>\n</span>\n</div>",
