    "prompt": "Find the resistance that must be placed in series with a 25.0 - Ω galvanometer having a 50.0 - μ A sensitivity (the same as the one discussed in the text) to allow it to be used as a…",
    "previewHTML": "<p>Find the resistance that must be placed in series with a <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>25.0</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mtext>Ω</mtext></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> galvanometer having a <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>50.0</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mi>μ</mi><mtext>A</mtext></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> sensitivity (the same as the one discussed in the text) to allow it to be used as a voltmeter with a 3000-V full-scale reading. Include a circuit diagram with your solution.</p>",
    "statementHTML": "<div>\n<p>Find the resistance that must be placed in series with a <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>25.0</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mtext>Ω</mtext></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> galvanometer having a <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>50.0</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mi>μ</mi><mtext>A</mtext></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> sensitivity (the same as the one discussed in the text) to allow it to be used as a voltmeter with a 3000-V full-scale reading. Include a circuit diagram with your solution.</p>\n</div>",
