    "category": "problems",
    "topic": "Self-Inductance and Inductors",
    "prompt": "A solenoid 50 cm long is wound with 500 turns of wire. The cross-sectional area of the coil is 2.0 cm 2 What is the self-inductance of the solenoid?",
    "previewHTML": "<p>A solenoid 50 cm long is wound with 500 turns of wire. The cross-sectional area of the coil is <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mn>2.0</mn><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mtext>cm</mtext></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> What is the self-inductance of the solenoid?</p>",
    "statementHTML": "<div>\n<p>A solenoid 50 cm long is wound with 500 turns of wire. The cross-sectional area of the coil is <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mn>2.0</mn><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mtext>cm</mtext></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> What is the self-inductance of the solenoid?</p>\n</div>",
