    "statementHTML": "<div>\n<p>Find the center of mass of a one-meter long rod, made of 50 cm of iron (density <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>8</mn><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mfrac><mtext>g</mtext><mrow><msup><mrow><mtext>cm</mtext></mrow><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span>) and 50 cm of aluminum (density <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>2.7</mn><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mfrac><mtext>g</mtext><mrow><msup><mrow><mtext>cm</mtext></mrow><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span>).</p>\n</div>",
