    "statementHTML": "<div>\n<p>(a) What is the electric field at the lower-right-hand corner of the square shown below? (b) What is the force on a charge <em>q</em> placed at that point?</p>\n<span>\n<img alt=\"A square with sides of length a is shown. Three charges are shown as follows: At the top left, a charge of negative 2 q. At the top right, a charge of positive q. At the lower left, a charge of positive q.\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"textbook-assets/84a636e5d2a52763a4368310.jpg\"/>\n</span>\n</div>",
