    "category": "additional-problems",
    "topic": "Magnetic forces",
    "prompt": "What magnetic field is required in order to confine a proton moving with a speed of 4.0 × 10 6 m/s to a circular orbit of radius 10 cm?",
    "previewHTML": "<p>What magnetic field is required in order to confine a proton moving with a speed of <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>4.0</mn><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mo>×</mo><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mn>6</mn></msup><mtext>m/s</mtext></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> to a circular orbit of radius 10 cm?</p>",
    "statementHTML": "<div>\n<p>What magnetic field is required in order to confine a proton moving with a speed of <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>4.0</mn><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mo>×</mo><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mn>6</mn></msup><mtext>m/s</mtext></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> to a circular orbit of radius 10 cm?</p>\n</div>",
