    "statementHTML": "<div>\n<p>Charge is distributed along the entire <em>x</em>-axis with uniform density <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>.</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> How much work does the electric field of this charge distribution do on an electron that moves along the <em>y</em>-axis from <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mtext>to</mtext><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>?</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span></p>\n</div>",
