    "statementHTML": "<div>\n<p>When the current through a circular loop is 6.0 A, the magnetic field at its center is <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>2.0</mn><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mo>×</mo><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mtext>−4</mtext></mrow></msup><mtext>T</mtext><mo>.</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> What is the radius of the loop?</p>\n</div>",
