    "statementHTML": "<div>\n<p>Find the force corresponding to the potential energy <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>U</mi><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mtext>−</mtext><mi>a</mi><mtext>/</mtext><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mtext>/</mtext><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>.</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span></p>\n</div>",
