    "statementHTML": "<div>\n<p>A heater is being designed that uses a coil of 14-gauge nichrome wire to generate 300 W using a voltage of <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>110</mn><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mtext>V</mtext></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span>. How long should the engineer make the wire?</p>\n</div>",
