    "statementHTML": "<div>\n<p>How many turns must be wound on a flat, circular coil of radius 20 cm in order to produce a magnetic field of magnitude <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>4.0</mn><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mo>×</mo><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mtext>−5</mtext></mrow></msup><mtext>T</mtext></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> at the center of the coil when the current through it is 0.85 A?</p>\n</div>",
