    "previewHTML": "<p>Find the center of mass of a cone of uniform density that has a radius <em>R</em> at the base, height <em>h</em>, and mass <em>M</em>. Let the origin be at the center of the base of the cone and have +<em>z</em> going through the cone vertex.</p>",
    "statementHTML": "<div>\n<p>Find the center of mass of a cone of uniform density that has a radius <em>R</em> at the base, height <em>h</em>, and mass <em>M</em>. Let the origin be at the center of the base of the cone and have +<em>z</em> going through the cone vertex.</p></div>",
    "url": "https://openstax.org/books/university-physics-volume-1/pages/9-problems#fs-id1167134942005",
    "solutionUrl": "https://openstax.org/books/university-physics-volume-1/pages/chapter-9#fs-id1167134942005-solution",
    "solutionHTML": "<div>\n<p>\n<span><math display=\"inline\">\n<semantics>\n<mrow>\n<mrow>\n<mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo>\n<msub>\n<mi>x</mi>\n<mrow>\n<mtext>CM</mtext>\n</mrow>\n</msub>\n<mo>,</mo>\n<msub>\n<mi>y</mi>\n<mrow>\n<mtext>CM</mtext>\n</mrow>\n</msub>\n<mo>,</mo>\n<msub>\n<mi>z</mi>\n<mrow>\n<mtext>CM</mtext>\n</mrow>\n</msub>\n<mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo>\n<mo>=</mo>\n<mrow>\n<mrow>\n<mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo>\n<mn>0,0</mn>\n<mo>,</mo>\n<mi>h</mi>\n</mrow>\n<mtext>/</mtext>\n<mn>4</mn>\n</mrow>\n<mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo>\n</mrow>\n</mrow>\n\n</semantics>\n</math></span>\n</p>\n</div>",
    "attributionHTML": "OpenStax, <em>University Physics Volume 1</em>, Chapter 9, Problem 73. Authors: William Moebs, Samuel J. Ling, and Jeff Sanny. <a href=\"https://openstax.org/books/university-physics-volume-1/pages/9-problems#fs-id1167134942005\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Access for free at OpenStax</a>. Content © Rice University, licensed <a href=\"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">CC BY-NC-SA 4.0</a>. Formatting adapted for this noncommercial local study app."
