    "previewHTML": "<p>Point charges of <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>25.0</mn><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mi>μ</mi><mtext>C</mtext><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mtext>and</mtext><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mn>45.0</mn><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mi>μ</mi><mtext>C</mtext></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> are placed 0.500 m apart.</p>",
    "statementHTML": "<div>\n<p>Point charges of <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>25.0</mn><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mi>μ</mi><mtext>C</mtext><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mtext>and</mtext><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mn>45.0</mn><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mi>μ</mi><mtext>C</mtext></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> are placed 0.500 m apart.</p>\n<p>(a) At what point along the line between them is the electric field zero?</p>\n<p>(b) What is the electric field halfway between them?</p>\n</div>",
