    "prompt": "A 90-kg football player jumps vertically into the air to catch a 0.50-kg football that is thrown essentially horizontally at him at 17 m/s. What is his horizontal speed after catching…",
    "previewHTML": "<p>A 90-kg football player jumps vertically into the air to catch a 0.50-kg football that is thrown essentially horizontally at him at 17 m/s. What is his horizontal speed after catching the ball?</p>",
    "statementHTML": "<div>\n<p>A 90-kg football player jumps vertically into the air to catch a 0.50-kg football that is thrown essentially horizontally at him at 17 m/s. What is his horizontal speed after catching the ball?</p>\n</div>",
    "url": "https://openstax.org/books/university-physics-volume-1/pages/9-additional-problems#fs-id1167132369938",
