    "number": 31,
    "category": "problems",
    "topic": "Conservation of Energy",
    "prompt": "A boy throws a ball of mass 0.25 kg straight upward with an initial speed of 20 m / s When the ball returns to the boy, its speed is 17 m / s How much much work does air resistance do on…",
    "previewHTML": "<p>A boy throws a ball of mass <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>0.25</mn><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mtext>kg</mtext></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> straight upward with an initial speed of <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>20</mn><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mtext>m</mtext><mtext>/</mtext><mtext>s</mtext></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> When the ball returns to the boy, its speed is <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>17</mn><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mtext>m</mtext><mtext>/</mtext><mtext>s</mtext></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> How much much work does air resistance do on the ball during its flight?</p>",
    "statementHTML": "<div>\n<p>A boy throws a ball of mass <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>0.25</mn><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mtext>kg</mtext></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> straight upward with an initial speed of <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>20</mn><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mtext>m</mtext><mtext>/</mtext><mtext>s</mtext></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> When the ball returns to the boy, its speed is <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>17</mn><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mtext>m</mtext><mtext>/</mtext><mtext>s</mtext></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> How much much work does air resistance do on the ball during its flight?</p>\n</div>",
    "url": "https://openstax.org/books/university-physics-volume-1/pages/8-problems#fs-id1165037017982",
    "solutionUrl": "https://openstax.org/books/university-physics-volume-1/pages/chapter-8#fs-id1165037017982-solution",
    "solutionHTML": "<div>\n<p>\n<span><math display=\"inline\">\n<semantics>\n<mrow>\n<mrow>\n<mn>–14</mn>\n<mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace>\n<mtext>J</mtext>\n</mrow>\n</mrow>\n\n</semantics>\n</math></span>\n</p>\n</div>",
    "attributionHTML": "OpenStax, <em>University Physics Volume 1</em>, Chapter 8, Problem 31. Authors: William Moebs, Samuel J. Ling, and Jeff Sanny. <a href=\"https://openstax.org/books/university-physics-volume-1/pages/8-problems#fs-id1165037017982\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Access for free at OpenStax</a>. Content © Rice University, licensed <a href=\"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">CC BY-NC-SA 4.0</a>. Formatting adapted for this noncommercial local study app."
