    "topic": "Electrical Energy and Power",
    "prompt": "The power dissipated by a resistor with a resistance of R = 100 Ω is P = 2.0 W . What are the current through and the voltage drop across the resistor?",
    "previewHTML": "<p>The power dissipated by a resistor with a resistance of <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>100</mn><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mtext>Ω</mtext></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> is <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2.0</mn><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mtext>W</mtext></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span>. What are the current through and the voltage drop across the resistor?</p>",
    "statementHTML": "<div>\n<p>The power dissipated by a resistor with a resistance of <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>100</mn><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mtext>Ω</mtext></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> is <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2.0</mn><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mtext>W</mtext></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span>. What are the current through and the voltage drop across the resistor?</p>\n</div>",
    "url": "https://openstax.org/books/university-physics-volume-2/pages/9-problems#fs-id1170904259309",
    "solutionUrl": "https://openstax.org/books/university-physics-volume-2/pages/chapter-9#fs-id1170904259309-solution",
    "solutionHTML": "<div>\n<p>\n<span><math display=\"inline\">\n<semantics>\n<mrow>\n<mrow>\n<mi>I</mi>\n<mo>=</mo>\n<mn>0.14</mn>\n<mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace>\n<mtext>A</mtext>\n<mo>,</mo>\n<mspace width=\"0.8em\"></mspace>\n<mi>V</mi>\n<mo>=</mo>\n<mn>14</mn>\n<mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace>\n<mtext>V</mtext>\n</mrow>\n</mrow>\n\n</semantics>\n</math></span>\n</p></div>",
    "attributionHTML": "OpenStax, <em>University Physics Volume 2</em>, Chapter 9, Problem 59. Authors: William Moebs, Samuel J. Ling, and Jeff Sanny. <a href=\"https://openstax.org/books/university-physics-volume-2/pages/9-problems#fs-id1170904259309\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Access for free at OpenStax</a>. Content © Rice University, licensed <a href=\"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">CC BY-NC-SA 4.0</a>. Formatting adapted for this noncommercial local study app."
