    "prompt": "Suppose that a rectangular toroid has 2000 windings and a self-inductance of 0.040 H. If h = 0.10 m , what is the current flowing through a rectangular toroid when the energy in its…",
    "previewHTML": "<p>Suppose that a rectangular toroid has 2000 windings and a self-inductance of 0.040 H. If <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.10</mn><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mtext>m</mtext></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span>, what is the current flowing through a rectangular toroid when the energy in its magnetic field is <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>2.0</mn><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mo>×</mo><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>−6</mn></mrow></msup><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mtext>J</mtext><mo>?</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span></p>",
    "statementHTML": "<div>\n<p>Suppose that a rectangular toroid has 2000 windings and a self-inductance of 0.040 H. If <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.10</mn><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mtext>m</mtext></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span>, what is the current flowing through a rectangular toroid when the energy in its magnetic field is <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>2.0</mn><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mo>×</mo><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>−6</mn></mrow></msup><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mtext>J</mtext><mo>?</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span></p>\n</div>",
