    "prompt": "Find the center of mass of a uniform thin semicircular plate of radius R . Let the origin be at the center of the semicircle, the plate arc from the + x axis to the −x axis, and the z…",
    "previewHTML": "<p>Find the center of mass of a uniform thin semicircular plate of radius <em>R</em>. Let the origin be at the center of the semicircle, the plate arc from the +<em>x</em> axis to the −x axis, and the <em>z</em> axis be perpendicular to the plate.</p>",
    "statementHTML": "<div>\n<p>Find the center of mass of a uniform thin semicircular plate of radius <em>R</em>. Let the origin be at the center of the semicircle, the plate arc from the +<em>x</em> axis to the −x axis, and the <em>z</em> axis be perpendicular to the plate.</p>\n</div>",
    "url": "https://openstax.org/books/university-physics-volume-1/pages/9-problems#fs-id1167134895265",
    "solutionUrl": "https://openstax.org/books/university-physics-volume-1/pages/chapter-9#fs-id1167134895265-solution",
    "solutionHTML": "<div>\n<p>\n<span><math display=\"inline\">\n<semantics>\n<mrow>\n<mrow>\n<mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo>\n<msub>\n<mi>x</mi>\n<mrow>\n<mtext>CM</mtext>\n</mrow>\n</msub>\n<mo>,</mo>\n<msub>\n<mi>y</mi>\n<mrow>\n<mtext>CM</mtext>\n</mrow>\n</msub>\n<mo>,</mo>\n<msub>\n<mi>z</mi>\n<mrow>\n<mtext>CM</mtext>\n</mrow>\n</msub>\n<mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo>\n<mo>=</mo>\n<mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo>\n<mn>0</mn>\n<mo>,</mo>\n<mrow>\n<mrow>\n<mn>4</mn>\n<mi>R</mi>\n</mrow>\n<mtext>/</mtext>\n<mrow>\n<mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo>\n<mn>3</mn>\n<mi>π</mi>\n<mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo>\n</mrow>\n</mrow>\n<mo>,</mo>\n<mn>0</mn>\n<mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo>\n</mrow>\n</mrow>\n\n</semantics>\n</math></span>\n</p>\n</div>",
    "attributionHTML": "OpenStax, <em>University Physics Volume 1</em>, Chapter 9, Problem 75. Authors: William Moebs, Samuel J. Ling, and Jeff Sanny. <a href=\"https://openstax.org/books/university-physics-volume-1/pages/9-problems#fs-id1167134895265\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Access for free at OpenStax</a>. Content © Rice University, licensed <a href=\"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">CC BY-NC-SA 4.0</a>. Formatting adapted for this noncommercial local study app."
