    "previewHTML": "<p>Find the center of mass of a sphere of mass <em>M</em> and radius <em>R</em> and a cylinder of mass <em>m</em>, radius <em>r</em>, and height <em>h</em> arranged as shown below.</p>",
    "statementHTML": "<div>\n<p>Find the center of mass of a sphere of mass <em>M</em> and radius <em>R</em> and a cylinder of mass <em>m</em>, radius <em>r</em>, and height <em>h</em> arranged as shown below.</p>\n<span>\n<img alt=\"Figure a has a sphere on top of a vertical cylinder. Figure b has a sphere centered on top of a horizontal cylinder.\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"textbook-assets/2851ee6f8bf3b0567aed7509.jpg\"/>\n</span>\n<p>Express your answers in a coordinate system that has the origin at the center of the cylinder.</p>\n</div>",
