    "solutionHTML": "<div>\n<p>a. <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>0.400</mn><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mtext>Ω</mtext></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span>; b. No, there is only one independent equation, so only <em>r</em> can be found.</p>\n</div>",
