    "prompt": "A singly charged ion is moving in a uniform magnetic field of 7.5 × 10 −2 T completes 10 revolutions in 3.47 × 10 −4 s . Identify the ion.",
    "previewHTML": "<p>A singly charged ion is moving in a uniform magnetic field of <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>7.5</mn><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mo>×</mo><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>−2</mn></mrow></msup><mtext>T</mtext></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> completes 10 revolutions in <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>3.47</mn><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mo>×</mo><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>−4</mn></mrow></msup><mtext>s</mtext><mo>.</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> Identify the ion.</p>",
    "statementHTML": "<div>\n<p>A singly charged ion is moving in a uniform magnetic field of <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>7.5</mn><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mo>×</mo><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>−2</mn></mrow></msup><mtext>T</mtext></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> completes 10 revolutions in <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>3.47</mn><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mo>×</mo><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>−4</mn></mrow></msup><mtext>s</mtext><mo>.</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> Identify the ion.</p>\n</div>",
