    "topic": "Rotation",
    "prompt": "Calculate the torque of the 40-N force around the axis through O and perpendicular to the plane of the page as shown below.",
    "previewHTML": "<p>Calculate the torque of the 40-N force around the axis through <em>O</em> and perpendicular to the plane of the page as shown below.</p>",
