    "source": "OpenStax",
    "volume": 1,
    "chapter": 8,
    "number": 39,
    "category": "problems",
    "topic": "Conservation of Energy",
    "prompt": "A sled of mass 70 kg starts from rest and slides down a 10 ° incline 80 m long. It then travels for 20 m horizontally before starting back up an 8 ° incline. It travels 80 m along this…",
    "previewHTML": "<p>A sled of mass 70 kg starts from rest and slides down a <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>10</mn><mtext>°</mtext></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> incline <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>80</mn><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mtext>m</mtext></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> long. It then travels for 20 m horizontally before starting back up an <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>8</mn><mtext>°</mtext></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> incline. It travels 80 m along this incline before coming to rest. What is the magnitude of the net work done on the sled by friction?</p>",
    "statementHTML": "<div>\n<p>A sled of mass 70 kg starts from rest and slides down a <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>10</mn><mtext>°</mtext></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> incline <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>80</mn><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mtext>m</mtext></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> long. It then travels for 20 m horizontally before starting back up an <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>8</mn><mtext>°</mtext></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> incline. It travels 80 m along this incline before coming to rest. What is the magnitude of the net work done on the sled by friction?</p></div>",
    "url": "https://openstax.org/books/university-physics-volume-1/pages/8-problems#fs-id1165036992728",
