    "prompt": "A marble is rolling across the floor at a speed of 7.0 m/s when it starts up a plane inclined at 30 ° to the horizontal. (a) How far along the plane does the marble travel before coming…",
    "previewHTML": "<p>A marble is rolling across the floor at a speed of 7.0 m/s when it starts up a plane inclined at <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>30</mn><mtext>°</mtext></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> to the horizontal. (a) How far along the plane does the marble travel before coming to a rest? (b) How much time elapses while the marble moves up the plane?</p>",
