    "statementHTML": "<div>\n<p>A cyclist in a race must climb a <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn><mtext>°</mtext></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> hill at a speed of 8 m/s. If the mass of the bike and the biker together is 80 kg, what must be the power output of the biker to achieve the goal?</p>\n</div>",
