    "topic": "Rocket Propulsion",
    "prompt": "What exhaust speed is required to accelerate a rocket in deep space from 800 m/s to 1000 m/s in 5.0 s if the total rocket mass is 1200 kg and the rocket only has 50 kg of fuel left?",
    "previewHTML": "<p>What exhaust speed is required to accelerate a rocket in deep space from 800 m/s to 1000 m/s in 5.0 s if the total rocket mass is 1200 kg and the rocket only has 50 kg of fuel left?</p>",
    "statementHTML": "<div>\n<p>What exhaust speed is required to accelerate a rocket in deep space from 800 m/s to 1000 m/s in 5.0 s if the total rocket mass is 1200 kg and the rocket only has 50 kg of fuel left?</p>\n</div>",
    "url": "https://openstax.org/books/university-physics-volume-1/pages/9-problems#fs-id1167132616660",
    "solutionUrl": "https://openstax.org/books/university-physics-volume-1/pages/chapter-9#fs-id1167132616660-solution",
    "solutionHTML": "<div>\n<p>4.9 km/s</p>\n</div>",
