    "category": "problems",
    "topic": "Resistors in Series and Parallel",
    "prompt": "(a) What is the resistance of a 1.00 × 10 2 - Ω , a 2.50 -k Ω , and a 4.00 -k Ω resistor connected in series? (b) In parallel?",
    "previewHTML": "<p>(a) What is the resistance of a <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>1.00</mn><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mo>×</mo><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mtext>-</mtext><mtext>Ω</mtext></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span>, a <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>2.50</mn><mtext>-k</mtext><mtext>Ω</mtext></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span>, and a <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>4.00</mn><mtext>-k</mtext><mtext>Ω</mtext></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> resistor connected in series? (b) In parallel?</p>",
    "statementHTML": "<div>\n<p>(a) What is the resistance of a <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>1.00</mn><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mo>×</mo><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mtext>-</mtext><mtext>Ω</mtext></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span>, a <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>2.50</mn><mtext>-k</mtext><mtext>Ω</mtext></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span>, and a <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>4.00</mn><mtext>-k</mtext><mtext>Ω</mtext></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> resistor connected in series? (b) In parallel?</p>\n</div>",
