    "prompt": "A coil with a self-inductance of 3.0 H and a resistance of 100 Ω carries a steady current of 2.0 A. (a) What is the energy stored in the magnetic field of the coil? (b) What is the…",
    "previewHTML": "<p>A coil with a self-inductance of 3.0 H and a resistance of <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>100</mn><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mtext>Ω</mtext></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> carries a steady current of 2.0 A. (a) What is the energy stored in the magnetic field of the coil? (b) What is the energy per second dissipated in the resistance of the coil?</p>",
    "statementHTML": "<div>\n<p>A coil with a self-inductance of 3.0 H and a resistance of <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>100</mn><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mtext>Ω</mtext></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> carries a steady current of 2.0 A. (a) What is the energy stored in the magnetic field of the coil? (b) What is the energy per second dissipated in the resistance of the coil?</p>\n</div>",
