    "topic": "Momentum and collisions",
    "prompt": "Where is the center of mass of a slice of pizza that was cut into eight equal slices? Assume the origin is at the apex of the slice and measure angles with respect to an edge of the…",
    "previewHTML": "<p>Where is the center of mass of a slice of pizza that was cut into eight equal slices? Assume the origin is at the apex of the slice and measure angles with respect to an edge of the slice. The radius of the pizza is <em>R</em>.</p>",
    "statementHTML": "<div>\n<p>Where is the center of mass of a slice of pizza that was cut into eight equal slices? Assume the origin is at the apex of the slice and measure angles with respect to an edge of the slice. The radius of the pizza is <em>R</em>.</p>\n</div>",
    "url": "https://openstax.org/books/university-physics-volume-1/pages/9-additional-problems#fs-id1167133717950",
    "solutionUrl": "https://openstax.org/books/university-physics-volume-1/pages/chapter-9#fs-id1167133717950-solution",
    "solutionHTML": "<div>\n<p>\n<span><math display=\"inline\">\n<semantics>\n<mrow>\n<mrow>\n<msub>\n<mn>θ</mn>\n<mtext>cm</mtext>\n</msub>\n</mrow>\n<mo>=</mo>\n<mfrac>\n<mn>1</mn>\n<mn>8</mn>\n</mfrac>\n<mtext>, </mtext>\n<msub>\n<mi>r</mi>\n<mtext>cm</mtext>\n</msub>\n<mo>=</mo>\n<mfrac>\n<mrow>\n<mn>8</mn>\n<mi>R</mi>\n</mrow>\n<mrow>\n<mn>3</mn>\n<mi>π</mi>\n</mrow>\n</mfrac>\n<msqrt>\n<mn>2</mn>\n<mo>-</mo>\n<msqrt>\n<mn>2</mn>\n</msqrt>\n</msqrt>\n</mrow>\n\n</semantics>\n</math></span>\n</p>\n</div>",
    "attributionHTML": "OpenStax, <em>University Physics Volume 1</em>, Chapter 9, Problem 110. Authors: William Moebs, Samuel J. Ling, and Jeff Sanny. <a href=\"https://openstax.org/books/university-physics-volume-1/pages/9-additional-problems#fs-id1167133717950\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Access for free at OpenStax</a>. Content © Rice University, licensed <a href=\"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">CC BY-NC-SA 4.0</a>. Formatting adapted for this noncommercial local study app."
