    "category": "additional-problems",
    "topic": "Angular momentum",
    "prompt": "A particle has mass 0.5 kg and is traveling along the line x = 5.0 m at 2.0 m/s in the positive y -direction. What is the particle’s angular momentum about the origin?",
    "previewHTML": "<p>A particle has mass 0.5 kg and is traveling along the line <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5.0</mn><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mtext>m</mtext></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> at 2.0 m/s in the positive <em>y</em>-direction. What is the particle’s angular momentum about the origin?</p>",
    "statementHTML": "<div>\n<p>A particle has mass 0.5 kg and is traveling along the line <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5.0</mn><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mtext>m</mtext></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> at 2.0 m/s in the positive <em>y</em>-direction. What is the particle’s angular momentum about the origin?</p>\n</div>",
