    "prompt": "How long after switch S 1 is thrown does it take the current in the circuit shown to reach half its maximum value? Express your answer in terms of the time constant of the circuit.",
    "previewHTML": "<p>How long after switch <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mtext>S</mtext><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> is thrown does it take the current in the circuit shown to reach half its maximum value? Express your answer in terms of the time constant of the circuit.</p>",
    "statementHTML": "<div>\n<p>How long after switch <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mtext>S</mtext><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> is thrown does it take the current in the circuit shown to reach half its maximum value? Express your answer in terms of the time constant of the circuit.</p>\n<span>\n<img alt=\"Figure shows a circuit with R and L in series with a battery, epsilon and a switch S1 which is open.\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"textbook-assets/572a1c0303c95dbe407cd81e.jpg\"/>\n</span>\n</div>",
