    "previewHTML": "<p>What is the ideal speed to take a 100.0-m-radius curve banked at a <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>20.0</mn><mtext>°</mtext></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> angle?</p>",
    "statementHTML": "<div>\n<p>What is the ideal speed to take a 100.0-m-radius curve banked at a <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>20.0</mn><mtext>°</mtext></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> angle?</p>\n</div>",
