    "topic": "Resistors in Series and Parallel",
    "prompt": "(a) Given a 48.0-V battery and 24.0 - Ω and 96.0 - Ω resistors, find the current and power for each when connected in series. (b) Repeat when the resistances are in parallel.",
    "previewHTML": "<p>(a) Given a 48.0-V battery and <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>24.0</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mtext>Ω</mtext></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> and <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>96.0</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mtext>Ω</mtext></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> resistors, find the current and power for each when connected in series. (b) Repeat when the resistances are in parallel.</p>",
    "statementHTML": "<div>\n<p>(a) Given a 48.0-V battery and <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>24.0</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mtext>Ω</mtext></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> and <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>96.0</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mtext>Ω</mtext></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> resistors, find the current and power for each when connected in series. (b) Repeat when the resistances are in parallel.</p>\n</div>",
