    "category": "additional-problems",
    "topic": "Magnetic forces",
    "prompt": "(a) What is the angle between a wire carrying an 8.00-A current and the 1.20-T field it is in if 50.0 cm of the wire experiences a magnetic force of 2.40 N? (b) What is the force on the…",
    "previewHTML": "<p>(a) What is the angle between a wire carrying an 8.00-A current and the 1.20-T field it is in if 50.0 cm of the wire experiences a magnetic force of 2.40 N? (b) What is the force on the wire if it is rotated to make an angle of 90º with the field?</p>",
    "statementHTML": "<div>\n<p>(a) What is the angle between a wire carrying an 8.00-A current and the 1.20-T field it is in if 50.0 cm of the wire experiences a magnetic force of 2.40 N? (b) What is the force on the wire if it is rotated to make an angle of 90º with the field?</p>\n</div>",
    "url": "https://openstax.org/books/university-physics-volume-2/pages/11-additional-problems#fs-id1171358206593",
    "solutionUrl": "https://openstax.org/books/university-physics-volume-2/pages/chapter-11#fs-id1171358206593-solution",
    "solutionHTML": "<div>\n<p>a. <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>30.0</mn><mtext>°</mtext><mo>;</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> b. 4.80 N</p>\n</div>",
