    "topic": "Uniform and Nonuniform Circular Motion",
    "prompt": "A fan is rotating at a constant 360.0 rev/min. What is the magnitude of the acceleration of a point on one of its blades 10.0 cm from the axis of rotation?",
    "previewHTML": "<p>A fan is rotating at a constant 360.0 rev/min. What is the magnitude of the acceleration of a point on one of its blades 10.0 cm from the axis of rotation?</p>",
    "statementHTML": "<div>\n<p>A fan is rotating at a constant 360.0 rev/min. What is the magnitude of the acceleration of a point on one of its blades 10.0 cm from the axis of rotation?</p>\n</div>",
    "url": "https://openstax.org/books/university-physics-volume-1/pages/4-problems#fs-id1165168934860",
    "solutionUrl": "https://openstax.org/books/university-physics-volume-1/pages/chapter-4#fs-id1165168934860-solution",
    "solutionHTML": "<div>\n<p><span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>360</mn><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mrow><mrow><mtext>rev</mtext></mrow><mtext>/</mtext><mrow><mtext>min</mtext></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mrow><mrow><mtext>rev</mtext></mrow><mtext>/</mtext><mtext>s</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span><span><br/></span>\n<span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3.8</mn><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mrow><mtext>m</mtext><mtext>/</mtext><mtext>s</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mtext>C</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>144.</mn><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mrow><mtext>m</mtext><mtext>/</mtext><mrow><msup><mtext>s</mtext><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span></p>\n</div>",
    "attributionHTML": "OpenStax, <em>University Physics Volume 1</em>, Chapter 4, Problem 67. Authors: William Moebs, Samuel J. Ling, and Jeff Sanny. <a href=\"https://openstax.org/books/university-physics-volume-1/pages/4-problems#fs-id1165168934860\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Access for free at OpenStax</a>. Content © Rice University, licensed <a href=\"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">CC BY-NC-SA 4.0</a>. Formatting adapted for this noncommercial local study app."
