    "topic": "Examples of Static Equilibrium",
    "prompt": "The uniform boom shown below weighs 700 N, and the object hanging from its right end weighs 400 N. The boom is supported by a light cable and by a hinge at the wall. Calculate the…",
    "previewHTML": "<p>The uniform boom shown below weighs 700 N, and the object hanging from its right end weighs 400 N. The boom is supported by a light cable and by a hinge at the wall. Calculate the tension in the cable and the force on the hinge on the boom. Does the force on the hinge act along the boom?</p>",
    "statementHTML": "<div>\n<p>The uniform boom shown below weighs 700 N, and the object hanging from its right end weighs 400 N. The boom is supported by a light cable and by a hinge at the wall. Calculate the tension in the cable and the force on the hinge on the boom. Does the force on the hinge act along the boom?</p>\n<span>\n<img alt=\"Figure is a schematic drawing of a 400 N weight that is by a cable and by a hinge at the wall. Hinge forms a 20 degree angle with the line perpendicular to the wall. Cable forms a 45 degree angle with the line perpendicular to the wall.\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"textbook-assets/e9d052a5866b3bad561f3a81.jpg\"/>\n</span>\n</div>",
    "url": "https://openstax.org/books/university-physics-volume-1/pages/12-problems#fs-id1163713017578",
    "solutionUrl": "https://openstax.org/books/university-physics-volume-1/pages/chapter-12#fs-id1163713017578-solution",
    "solutionHTML": "<div>\n<p>tension 778 N; at hinge 778 N at <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>45</mn><mtext>°</mtext></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> above the horizontal; no</p>\n</div>",
    "attributionHTML": "OpenStax, <em>University Physics Volume 1</em>, Chapter 12, Problem 41. Authors: William Moebs, Samuel J. Ling, and Jeff Sanny. <a href=\"https://openstax.org/books/university-physics-volume-1/pages/12-problems#fs-id1163713017578\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Access for free at OpenStax</a>. Content © Rice University, licensed <a href=\"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">CC BY-NC-SA 4.0</a>. Formatting adapted for this noncommercial local study app."
