    "previewHTML": "<p>A point located on the second hand of a large clock has a radial acceleration of <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>0.1</mn><mrow><mrow><mtext>cm</mtext></mrow><mtext>/</mtext><mrow><msup><mtext>s</mtext><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mrow><mo>.</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> How far is the point from the axis of rotation of the second hand?</p>",
    "statementHTML": "<div>\n<p>A point located on the second hand of a large clock has a radial acceleration of <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>0.1</mn><mrow><mrow><mtext>cm</mtext></mrow><mtext>/</mtext><mrow><msup><mtext>s</mtext><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mrow><mo>.</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> How far is the point from the axis of rotation of the second hand?</p>\n</div>",
