    "statementHTML": "<div>\n<p>A car rounds an unbanked curve of radius 65 m. If the coefficient of static friction between the road and car is 0.70, what is the maximum speed at which the car can traverse the curve without slipping?</p></div>",
    "url": "https://openstax.org/books/university-physics-volume-1/pages/6-problems#fs-id1165039071024",
