    "topic": "Solenoids and Toroids",
    "prompt": "A solenoid has 12 turns per centimeter. What current will produce a magnetic field of 2.0 × 10 −2 T within the solenoid?",
    "previewHTML": "<p>A solenoid has 12 turns per centimeter. What current will produce a magnetic field of <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>2.0</mn><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mo>×</mo><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>−2</mn></mrow></msup><mtext>T</mtext></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> within the solenoid?</p>",
    "statementHTML": "<div>\n<p>A solenoid has 12 turns per centimeter. What current will produce a magnetic field of <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>2.0</mn><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mo>×</mo><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>−2</mn></mrow></msup><mtext>T</mtext></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> within the solenoid?</p>\n</div>",
