    "topic": "Conservation of Energy",
    "prompt": "Using energy considerations and assuming negligible air resistance, show that a rock thrown from a bridge 20.0 m above water with an initial speed of 15.0 m/s strikes the water with a…",
    "previewHTML": "<p>Using energy considerations and assuming negligible air resistance, show that a rock thrown from a bridge 20.0 m above water with an initial speed of 15.0 m/s strikes the water with a speed of 24.8 m/s independent of the direction thrown. (<em>Hint:</em> show that <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>K</mi><mtext>i</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>U</mi><mtext>i</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>K</mi><mtext>f</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>U</mi><mtext>f</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span></p>",
    "statementHTML": "<div>\n<p>Using energy considerations and assuming negligible air resistance, show that a rock thrown from a bridge 20.0 m above water with an initial speed of 15.0 m/s strikes the water with a speed of 24.8 m/s independent of the direction thrown. (<em>Hint:</em> show that <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>K</mi><mtext>i</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>U</mi><mtext>i</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>K</mi><mtext>f</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>U</mi><mtext>f</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span></p>\n</div>",
    "url": "https://openstax.org/books/university-physics-volume-1/pages/8-problems#fs-id1165038348620",
    "solutionUrl": "https://openstax.org/books/university-physics-volume-1/pages/chapter-8#fs-id1165038348620-solution",
    "solutionHTML": "<div>\n<p>proof</p>\n</div>",
    "attributionHTML": "OpenStax, <em>University Physics Volume 1</em>, Chapter 8, Problem 33. Authors: William Moebs, Samuel J. Ling, and Jeff Sanny. <a href=\"https://openstax.org/books/university-physics-volume-1/pages/8-problems#fs-id1165038348620\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Access for free at OpenStax</a>. Content © Rice University, licensed <a href=\"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">CC BY-NC-SA 4.0</a>. Formatting adapted for this noncommercial local study app."
