    "topic": "Solenoids and Toroids",
    "prompt": "Determine the magnetic field on the central axis at the opening of a semi-infinite solenoid. (That is, take the opening to be at x = 0 and the other end to be at x = ∞ . )",
    "previewHTML": "<p>Determine the magnetic field on the central axis at the opening of a semi-infinite solenoid. (That is, take the opening to be at <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> and the other end to be at<span><br/></span><span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>∞</mi><mo>.</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span>)</p>",
    "statementHTML": "<div>\n<p>Determine the magnetic field on the central axis at the opening of a semi-infinite solenoid. (That is, take the opening to be at <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> and the other end to be at<span><br/></span><span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>∞</mi><mo>.</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span>)</p>\n</div>",
