    "solutionUrl": "https://openstax.org/books/university-physics-volume-2/pages/chapter-12#fs-id1166166206996-solution",
    "solutionHTML": "<div>\n<p>\n<span><math display=\"inline\">\n<semantics>\n<mrow>\n<mrow>\n<mi>B</mi>\n<mo>=</mo>\n<mfrac>\n<mn>1</mn>\n<mn>2</mn>\n</mfrac>\n<msub>\n<mi>μ</mi>\n<mn>0</mn>\n</msub>\n<mi>n</mi>\n<mi>I</mi>\n</mrow>\n</mrow>\n\n</semantics>\n</math></span>\n</p>\n</div>",
