    "category": "problems",
    "topic": "Applying Gauss’s Law",
    "prompt": "A total charge Q is distributed uniformly throughout a spherical shell of inner and outer radii r 1 and r 2 , respectively. Show that the electric field due to the charge is E → = 0 → (…",
    "previewHTML": "<p>A total charge <em>Q</em> is distributed uniformly throughout a spherical shell of inner and outer radii <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mtext>and</mtext><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><msub><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>,</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> respectively. Show that the electric field due to the charge is</p>",
    "statementHTML": "<div>\n<p>A total charge <em>Q</em> is distributed uniformly throughout a spherical shell of inner and outer radii <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mtext>and</mtext><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><msub><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>,</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> respectively. Show that the electric field due to the charge is</p>\n<p>\n<span><math display=\"inline\">\n<semantics>\n<mrow>\n<mtable>\n<mtr>\n<mtd columnalign=\"left\">\n<mstyle mathvariant=\"bold\">\n<mover accent=\"true\">\n<mtext>E</mtext>\n<mo stretchy=\"false\">→</mo>\n</mover>\n</mstyle>\n<mo>=</mo>\n<mstyle mathvariant=\"bold\">\n<mover accent=\"true\">\n<mn>0</mn>\n<mo stretchy=\"false\">→</mo>\n</mover>\n</mstyle>\n</mtd>\n<mtd></mtd>\n<mtd></mtd>\n<mtd columnalign=\"left\">\n<mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo>\n<mi>r</mi>\n<mo>≤</mo>\n<msub>\n<mi>r</mi>\n<mn>1</mn>\n</msub>\n<mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo>\n<mo>;</mo>\n</mtd>\n</mtr>\n<mtr>\n<mtd columnalign=\"left\">\n<mstyle mathvariant=\"bold\">\n<mover accent=\"true\">\n<mtext>E</mtext>\n<mo stretchy=\"false\">→</mo>\n</mover>\n</mstyle>\n<mo>=</mo>\n<mfrac>\n<mi>Q</mi>\n<mrow>\n<mn>4</mn>\n<mi>π</mi>\n<msub>\n<mi>ε</mi>\n<mn>0</mn>\n</msub>\n<msup>\n<mi>r</mi>\n<mn>2</mn>\n</msup>\n</mrow>\n</mfrac>\n<mrow>\n<mo>(</mo>\n<mrow>\n<mfrac>\n<mrow>\n<msup>\n<mi>r</mi>\n<mn>3</mn>\n</msup>\n<mo>−</mo>\n<msub>\n<mi>r</mi>\n<mn>1</mn>\n</msub>\n<msup>\n<mrow></mrow>\n<mn>3</mn>\n</msup>\n</mrow>\n<mrow>\n<msub>\n<mi>r</mi>\n<mn>2</mn>\n</msub>\n<msup>\n<mrow></mrow>\n<mn>3</mn>\n</msup>\n<mo>−</mo>\n<msub>\n<mi>r</mi>\n<mn>1</mn>\n</msub>\n<msup>\n<mrow></mrow>\n<mn>3</mn>\n</msup>\n</mrow>\n</mfrac>\n</mrow>\n<mo>)</mo>\n</mrow>\n<mstyle mathvariant=\"bold\">\n<mover accent=\"true\">\n<mtext>r</mtext>\n<mo>^</mo>\n</mover>\n</mstyle>\n</mtd>\n<mtd></mtd>\n<mtd></mtd>\n<mtd columnalign=\"left\">\n<mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo>\n<msub>\n<mi>r</mi>\n<mn>1</mn>\n</msub>\n<mo>≤</mo>\n<mi>r</mi>\n<mo>≤</mo>\n<msub>\n<mi>r</mi>\n<mn>2</mn>\n</msub>\n<mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo>\n<mo>;</mo>\n</mtd>\n</mtr>\n<mtr>\n<mtd columnalign=\"left\">\n<mstyle mathvariant=\"bold\">\n<mover accent=\"true\">\n<mtext>E</mtext>\n<mo stretchy=\"false\">→</mo>\n</mover>\n</mstyle>\n<mo>=</mo>\n<mfrac>\n<mi>Q</mi>\n<mrow>\n<mn>4</mn>\n<mi>π</mi>\n<msub>\n<mi>ε</mi>\n<mn>0</mn>\n</msub>\n<msup>\n<mi>r</mi>\n<mn>2</mn>\n</msup>\n</mrow>\n</mfrac>\n<mstyle mathvariant=\"bold\">\n<mover accent=\"true\">\n<mtext>r</mtext>\n<mo>^</mo>\n</mover>\n</mstyle>\n</mtd>\n<mtd></mtd>\n<mtd></mtd>\n<mtd columnalign=\"left\">\n<mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo>\n<mi>r</mi>\n<mo>≥</mo>\n<msub>\n<mi>r</mi>\n<mn>2</mn>\n</msub>\n<mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo>\n<mo>.</mo>\n</mtd>\n</mtr>\n</mtable>\n</mrow>\n</semantics>\n</math></span>\n</p>\n</div>",
    "url": "https://openstax.org/books/university-physics-volume-2/pages/6-problems#fs-id1172097516398",
    "attributionHTML": "OpenStax, <em>University Physics Volume 2</em>, Chapter 6, Problem 46. Authors: William Moebs, Samuel J. Ling, and Jeff Sanny. <a href=\"https://openstax.org/books/university-physics-volume-2/pages/6-problems#fs-id1172097516398\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Access for free at OpenStax</a>. Content © Rice University, licensed <a href=\"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">CC BY-NC-SA 4.0</a>. Formatting adapted for this noncommercial local study app."
