    "prompt": "A ship sets sail from Rotterdam, heading due north at 7.00 m/s relative to the water. The local ocean current is 1.50 m/s in a direction 4 0 . 0 ° north of east. What is the velocity of…",
    "previewHTML": "<p>A ship sets sail from Rotterdam, heading due north at 7.00 m/s relative to the water. The local ocean current is 1.50 m/s in a direction <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>0</mn><mtext>°</mtext></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> north of east. What is the velocity of the ship relative to Earth?</p>",
    "statementHTML": "<div>\n<p>A ship sets sail from Rotterdam, heading due north at 7.00 m/s relative to the water. The local ocean current is 1.50 m/s in a direction <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>0</mn><mtext>°</mtext></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> north of east. What is the velocity of the ship relative to Earth?</p>\n</div>",
