    "previewHTML": "<p>Tarzan grabs a vine hanging vertically from a tall tree when he is running at <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>9.0</mn><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mtext>m</mtext><mtext>/</mtext><mtext>s</mtext><mo>.</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> (a) How high can he swing upward? (b) Does the length of the vine affect this height?</p>",
