    "prompt": "By what factor does the drag force on a car increase as it goes from 65 to 110 km/h?",
    "previewHTML": "<p>By what factor does the drag force on a car increase as it goes from 65 to 110 km/h?</p>",
    "statementHTML": "<div>\n<p>By what factor does the drag force on a car increase as it goes from 65 to 110 km/h?</p>\n</div>",
