    "solutionUrl": "https://openstax.org/books/university-physics-volume-1/pages/chapter-6#fs-id1165039477110-solution",
    "solutionHTML": "<div>\n<p><span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>110</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>65</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2.86</mn></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> times</p>\n</div>",
    "attributionHTML": "OpenStax, <em>University Physics Volume 1</em>, Chapter 6, Problem 83. Authors: William Moebs, Samuel J. Ling, and Jeff Sanny. <a href=\"https://openstax.org/books/university-physics-volume-1/pages/6-problems#fs-id1165039477110\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Access for free at OpenStax</a>. Content © Rice University, licensed <a href=\"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">CC BY-NC-SA 4.0</a>. Formatting adapted for this noncommercial local study app."
