    "prompt": "A small block of mass m slides without friction around the loop-the-loop apparatus shown below. (a) If the block starts from rest at A , what is its speed at B ? (b) What is the force of…",
    "previewHTML": "<p>A small block of mass <em>m</em> slides without friction around the loop-the-loop apparatus shown below. (a) If the block starts from rest at <em>A</em>, what is its speed at <em>B</em>? (b) What is the force of the track on the block at <em>B</em>?</p>",
