    "prompt": "A toroid with a square cross section 3.0 cm × 3.0 cm has an inner radius of 25.0 cm. It is wound with 500 turns of wire, and it carries a current of 2.0 A. What is the strength of the…",
    "previewHTML": "<p>A toroid with a square cross section 3.0 cm <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mo>×</mo><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace></mrow></semantics></math></span> 3.0 cm has an inner radius of 25.0 cm. It is wound with 500 turns of wire, and it carries a current of 2.0 A. What is the strength of the magnetic field at the center of the square cross section?</p>",
    "statementHTML": "<div>\n<p>A toroid with a square cross section 3.0 cm <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mo>×</mo><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace></mrow></semantics></math></span> 3.0 cm has an inner radius of 25.0 cm. It is wound with 500 turns of wire, and it carries a current of 2.0 A. What is the strength of the magnetic field at the center of the square cross section?</p>\n</div>",
