    "prompt": "An airplane accelerates at 5.00 m/s 2 for 30.0 s. During this time, it covers a distance of 10.0 km. What are the initial and final velocities of the airplane?",
    "previewHTML": "<p>An airplane accelerates at 5.00 m/s<sup>2</sup> for 30.0 s. During this time, it covers a distance of 10.0 km. What are the initial and final velocities of the airplane?</p>",
    "statementHTML": "<div>\n<p>An airplane accelerates at 5.00 m/s<sup>2</sup> for 30.0 s. During this time, it covers a distance of 10.0 km. What are the initial and final velocities of the airplane?</p>\n</div>",
