    "prompt": "Evaluate the magnitude of gravitational force between two 5-kg spherical steel balls separated by a center-to-center distance of 15 cm.",
    "previewHTML": "<p>Evaluate the magnitude of gravitational force between two 5-kg spherical steel balls separated by a center-to-center distance of 15 cm.</p>",
    "statementHTML": "<div>\n<p>Evaluate the magnitude of gravitational force between two 5-kg spherical steel balls separated by a center-to-center distance of 15 cm.</p>\n</div>",
    "url": "https://openstax.org/books/university-physics-volume-1/pages/13-problems#fs-id1168328366602",
    "solutionUrl": "https://openstax.org/books/university-physics-volume-1/pages/chapter-13#fs-id1168328366602-solution",
    "solutionHTML": "<div>\n<p>\n<span><math display=\"inline\">\n<semantics>\n<mrow>\n<mrow>\n<mn>7.4</mn>\n<mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace>\n<mo>×</mo>\n<mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace>\n<msup>\n<mrow>\n<mn>10</mn>\n</mrow>\n<mrow>\n<mn>−8</mn>\n</mrow>\n</msup>\n<mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace>\n<mtext>N</mtext>\n</mrow>\n</mrow>\n\n</semantics>\n</math></span>\n</p>\n</div>",
    "attributionHTML": "OpenStax, <em>University Physics Volume 1</em>, Chapter 13, Problem 13. Authors: William Moebs, Samuel J. Ling, and Jeff Sanny. <a href=\"https://openstax.org/books/university-physics-volume-1/pages/13-problems#fs-id1168328366602\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Access for free at OpenStax</a>. Content © Rice University, licensed <a href=\"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">CC BY-NC-SA 4.0</a>. Formatting adapted for this noncommercial local study app."
