    "statementHTML": "<div>\n<p>Using the exact exponential treatment, determine how much time is required to charge an initially uncharged 100-pF capacitor through a <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>75.0</mn><mtext>-M</mtext><mtext>Ω</mtext></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> resistor to <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>90.0</mn><mi>%</mi></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> of its final voltage.</p>\n</div>",
