    "prompt": "A solenoid has a ferromagnetic core, n = 1000 turns per meter, and I = 5.0 A. If B inside the solenoid is 2.0 T, what is χ for the core material?",
    "previewHTML": "<p>A solenoid has a ferromagnetic core, <em>n</em> = 1000 turns per meter, and <em>I</em> = 5.0 A. If <em>B</em> inside the solenoid is 2.0 T, what is <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>χ</mi></mrow></semantics></math></span> for the core material?</p>",
