    "prompt": "Suppose you wish to produce a 1.2-T magnetic field in a toroid with an iron core for which χ = 4.0 × 10 3 . The toroid has a mean radius of 15 cm and is wound with 500 turns. What…",
    "previewHTML": "<p>Suppose you wish to produce a 1.2-T magnetic field in a toroid with an iron core for which <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>χ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4.0</mn><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mo>×</mo><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>.</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> The toroid has a mean radius of 15 cm and is wound with 500 turns. What current is required?</p>",
    "statementHTML": "<div>\n<p>Suppose you wish to produce a 1.2-T magnetic field in a toroid with an iron core for which <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>χ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4.0</mn><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mo>×</mo><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>.</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> The toroid has a mean radius of 15 cm and is wound with 500 turns. What current is required?</p>\n</div>",
