    "prompt": "In the cartoon movie Pocahontas , Pocahontas runs to the edge of a cliff and jumps off, showcasing the fun side of her personality. (a) If she is running at 3.0 m/s before jumping off…",
    "previewHTML": "<p>In the cartoon movie <em><a href=\"https://openstax.org/l/21pocahontclip\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Pocahontas</a></em>, Pocahontas runs to the edge of a cliff and jumps off, showcasing the fun side of her personality. (a) If she is running at 3.0 m/s before jumping off the cliff and she hits the water at the bottom of the cliff at 20.0 m/s, how high is the cliff? Assume negligible air drag in this cartoon. (b) If she jumped off the same cliff from a standstill, how fast would she be falling right before she hit the water?</p>",
    "statementHTML": "<div>\n<p>In the cartoon movie <em><a href=\"https://openstax.org/l/21pocahontclip\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Pocahontas</a></em>, Pocahontas runs to the edge of a cliff and jumps off, showcasing the fun side of her personality. (a) If she is running at 3.0 m/s before jumping off the cliff and she hits the water at the bottom of the cliff at 20.0 m/s, how high is the cliff? Assume negligible air drag in this cartoon. (b) If she jumped off the same cliff from a standstill, how fast would she be falling right before she hit the water?</p>\n</div>",
