    "prompt": "A current of 1.5 A flows through the windings of a large, thin toroid with 200 turns per meter and a radius of 1 meter. If the toroid is filled with iron for which χ = 3.0 × 10 3 , what…",
    "previewHTML": "<p>A current of 1.5 A flows through the windings of a large, thin toroid with 200 turns per meter and a radius of 1 meter. If the toroid is filled with iron for which <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>χ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3.0</mn><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mo>×</mo><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>,</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> what is the magnetic field within it?</p>",
    "statementHTML": "<div>\n<p>A current of 1.5 A flows through the windings of a large, thin toroid with 200 turns per meter and a radius of 1 meter. If the toroid is filled with iron for which <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>χ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3.0</mn><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mo>×</mo><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>,</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> what is the magnetic field within it?</p></div>",
