    "prompt": "Two forces are applied to a 5.0-kg object, and it accelerates at a rate of 2.0 m/s 2 in the positive y -direction. If one of the forces acts in the positive x -direction with magnitude…",
    "previewHTML": "<p>Two forces are applied to a 5.0-kg object, and it accelerates at a rate of <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>2.0</mn><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><msup><mrow><mtext>m/s</mtext></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> in the positive <em>y</em>-direction. If one of the forces acts in the positive <em>x</em>-direction with magnitude 12.0 N, find the magnitude of the other force.</p>",
    "statementHTML": "<div>\n<p>Two forces are applied to a 5.0-kg object, and it accelerates at a rate of <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>2.0</mn><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><msup><mrow><mtext>m/s</mtext></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> in the positive <em>y</em>-direction. If one of the forces acts in the positive <em>x</em>-direction with magnitude 12.0 N, find the magnitude of the other force.</p>\n</div>",
