    "prompt": "In the Back to the Future movies , a DeLorean car of mass 1230 kg travels at 88 miles per hour to venture back to the future. (a) What is the kinetic energy of the DeLorean? (b) What…",
    "previewHTML": "<p>In the <a href=\"https://openstax.org/l/21bactofutclip\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><em>Back to the Future</em> movies</a>, a DeLorean car of mass 1230 kg travels at 88 miles per hour to venture back to the future. (a) What is the kinetic energy of the DeLorean? (b) What spring constant would be needed to stop this DeLorean in a distance of 0.1m?</p>",
    "statementHTML": "<div>\n<p>In the <a href=\"https://openstax.org/l/21bactofutclip\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><em>Back to the Future</em> movies</a>, a DeLorean car of mass 1230 kg travels at 88 miles per hour to venture back to the future. (a) What is the kinetic energy of the DeLorean? (b) What spring constant would be needed to stop this DeLorean in a distance of 0.1m?</p></div>",
