    "prompt": "Find the current through a person and identify the likely effect on her if she touches a 120-V ac source: (a) if she is standing on a rubber mat and offers a total resistance of 4000 k Ω…",
    "previewHTML": "<p>Find the current through a person and identify the likely effect on her if she touches a 120-V ac source: (a) if she is standing on a rubber mat and offers a total resistance of <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>4000</mn><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mtext>k</mtext><mtext>Ω</mtext></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span>; (b) if she is standing barefoot on wet grass and has a resistance of only <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>300</mn><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mtext>k</mtext><mtext>Ω</mtext></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span>.</p>",
    "statementHTML": "<div>\n<p>Find the current through a person and identify the likely effect on her if she touches a 120-V ac source: (a) if she is standing on a rubber mat and offers a total resistance of <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>4000</mn><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mtext>k</mtext><mtext>Ω</mtext></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span>; (b) if she is standing barefoot on wet grass and has a resistance of only <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>300</mn><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mtext>k</mtext><mtext>Ω</mtext></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span>.</p>\n</div>",
