    "category": "problems",
    "topic": "Solving Problems with Newton’s Laws",
    "prompt": "When starting a foot race, a 70.0-kg sprinter exerts an average force of 650 N backward on the ground for 0.800 s. (a) What is their final speed? (b) How far do they travel?",
    "previewHTML": "<p>When starting a foot race, a 70.0-kg sprinter exerts an average force of 650 N backward on the ground for 0.800 s. (a) What is their final speed? (b) How far do they travel?</p>",
    "statementHTML": "<div>\n<p>When starting a foot race, a 70.0-kg sprinter exerts an average force of 650 N backward on the ground for 0.800 s. (a) What is their final speed? (b) How far do they travel?</p>\n</div>",
    "url": "https://openstax.org/books/university-physics-volume-1/pages/6-problems#fs-id1165037017931",
