    "prompt": "A 20.0-g ball hangs from the roof of a freight car by a string. When the freight car begins to move, the string makes an angle of 35.0 ° with the vertical. (a) What is the acceleration…",
    "previewHTML": "<p>A 20.0-g ball hangs from the roof of a freight car by a string. When the freight car begins to move, the string makes an angle of <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>35.0</mn><mtext>°</mtext></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> with the vertical. (a) What is the acceleration of the freight car? (b) What is the tension in the string?</p>",
    "statementHTML": "<div>\n<p>A 20.0-g ball hangs from the roof of a freight car by a string. When the freight car begins to move, the string makes an angle of <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>35.0</mn><mtext>°</mtext></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> with the vertical. (a) What is the acceleration of the freight car? (b) What is the tension in the string?</p>\n</div>",
    "url": "https://openstax.org/books/university-physics-volume-1/pages/6-problems#fs-id1165038203868",
    "attributionHTML": "OpenStax, <em>University Physics Volume 1</em>, Chapter 6, Problem 38. Authors: William Moebs, Samuel J. Ling, and Jeff Sanny. <a href=\"https://openstax.org/books/university-physics-volume-1/pages/6-problems#fs-id1165038203868\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Access for free at OpenStax</a>. Content © Rice University, licensed <a href=\"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">CC BY-NC-SA 4.0</a>. Formatting adapted for this noncommercial local study app."
