    "category": "additional-problems",
    "topic": "DC circuits",
    "prompt": "Three 300 - Ω resistors are connect in series with an AAA battery with a rating of 3 AmpHours. (a) How long can the battery supply the resistors with power? (b) If the resistors are…",
    "previewHTML": "<p>Three <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>300</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mtext>Ω</mtext></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> resistors are connect in series with an AAA battery with a rating of 3 AmpHours. (a) How long can the battery supply the resistors with power? (b) If the resistors are connected in parallel, how long can the battery last?</p>",
    "statementHTML": "<div>\n<p>Three <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>300</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mtext>Ω</mtext></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> resistors are connect in series with an AAA battery with a rating of 3 AmpHours. (a) How long can the battery supply the resistors with power? (b) If the resistors are connected in parallel, how long can the battery last?</p>\n</div>",
    "url": "https://openstax.org/books/university-physics-volume-2/pages/10-additional-problems#fs-id1172099514038",
    "solutionUrl": "https://openstax.org/books/university-physics-volume-2/pages/chapter-10#fs-id1172099514038-solution0",
    "solutionHTML": "<div>\n<p>a. <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mtext>A</mtext><mo>·</mo><mtext>h</mtext></mrow><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1.5</mn><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mtext>V</mtext></mrow><mrow><mn>900</mn><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mtext>Ω</mtext></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1800</mn><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mtext>h</mtext></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span>; b. <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mtext>A</mtext><mo>·</mo><mtext>h</mtext></mrow><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1.5</mn><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mtext>V</mtext></mrow><mrow><mn>100</mn><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mtext>Ω</mtext></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>200</mn><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mtext>h</mtext></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span></p>\n</div>",
    "attributionHTML": "OpenStax, <em>University Physics Volume 2</em>, Chapter 10, Problem 73. Authors: William Moebs, Samuel J. Ling, and Jeff Sanny. <a href=\"https://openstax.org/books/university-physics-volume-2/pages/10-additional-problems#fs-id1172099514038\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Access for free at OpenStax</a>. Content © Rice University, licensed <a href=\"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">CC BY-NC-SA 4.0</a>. Formatting adapted for this noncommercial local study app."
