    "topic": "Projectile Motion",
    "prompt": "A bullet is shot horizontally from shoulder height (1.5 m) with an initial speed 200 m/s. (a) How much time elapses before the bullet hits the ground? (b) How far does the bullet travel…",
    "previewHTML": "<p>A bullet is shot horizontally from shoulder height (1.5 m) with an initial speed 200 m/s. (a) How much time elapses before the bullet hits the ground? (b) How far does the bullet travel horizontally?</p>",
    "statementHTML": "<div>\n<p>A bullet is shot horizontally from shoulder height (1.5 m) with an initial speed 200 m/s. (a) How much time elapses before the bullet hits the ground? (b) How far does the bullet travel horizontally?</p></div>",
    "url": "https://openstax.org/books/university-physics-volume-1/pages/4-problems#fs-id1165168143712",
    "solutionUrl": "https://openstax.org/books/university-physics-volume-1/pages/chapter-4#fs-id1165168143712-solution",
    "solutionHTML": "<div>\n<p>a. <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.55</mn><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mtext>s</mtext></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span>, b. <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>110</mn><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mtext>m</mtext></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span></p>\n</div>",
    "attributionHTML": "OpenStax, <em>University Physics Volume 1</em>, Chapter 4, Problem 33. Authors: William Moebs, Samuel J. Ling, and Jeff Sanny. <a href=\"https://openstax.org/books/university-physics-volume-1/pages/4-problems#fs-id1165168143712\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Access for free at OpenStax</a>. Content © Rice University, licensed <a href=\"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">CC BY-NC-SA 4.0</a>. Formatting adapted for this noncommercial local study app."
