    "prompt": "Consider the circuit shown below. What is the energy stored in each capacitor after the switch has been closed for a very long time?",
    "previewHTML": "<p>Consider the circuit shown below. What is the energy stored in each capacitor after the switch has been closed for a very long time?</p>",
    "statementHTML": "<div>\n<p>Consider the circuit shown below. What is the energy stored in each capacitor after the switch has been closed for a very long time?</p>\n<span>\n<img alt=\"The positive terminal of voltage source V of 12 V is connected to an open switch. The other end of the open switch is connected to resistor R subscript 1 of 100 Ω which is connected to two parallel branches. The first branch has capacitor C subscript 1 of 10 mF and R subscript 2 of 100 Ω. The second branch has R subscript 3 of 100 Ω and C subscript 2 of 4.7 mF.\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://openstax.org/apps/archive/20260604.144757/resources/b0702821a46a7a2e932fab6996175c27f45670e2\"/>\n</span>\n</div>",
    "url": "https://openstax.org/books/university-physics-volume-2/pages/10-additional-problems#fs-id1172099386985",
    "solutionUrl": "https://openstax.org/books/university-physics-volume-2/pages/chapter-10#fs-id1172099386985-solution",
    "solutionHTML": "<div>\n<p>\n<span><math display=\"inline\">\n<semantics>\n<mrow>\n<mrow>\n<msub>\n<mi>U</mi>\n<mn>1</mn>\n</msub>\n<mo>=</mo>\n<msub>\n<mi>C</mi>\n<mn>1</mn>\n</msub>\n<msubsup>\n<mi>V</mi>\n<mn>1</mn>\n<mn>2</mn>\n</msubsup>\n<mo>=</mo>\n<mn>0.72</mn>\n<mtext>J</mtext>\n<mo>,</mo>\n<mspace width=\"0.5em\"></mspace>\n<msub>\n<mi>U</mi>\n<mn>2</mn>\n</msub>\n<mo>=</mo>\n<msub>\n<mi>C</mi>\n<mn>2</mn>\n</msub>\n<msubsup>\n<mi>V</mi>\n<mn>2</mn>\n<mn>2</mn>\n</msubsup>\n<mo>=</mo>\n<mn>0.338</mn>\n<mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace>\n<mtext>J</mtext>\n</mrow>\n</mrow>\n\n</semantics>\n</math></span>\n</p></div>",
    "attributionHTML": "OpenStax, <em>University Physics Volume 2</em>, Chapter 10, Problem 75. Authors: William Moebs, Samuel J. Ling, and Jeff Sanny. <a href=\"https://openstax.org/books/university-physics-volume-2/pages/10-additional-problems#fs-id1172099386985\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Access for free at OpenStax</a>. Content © Rice University, licensed <a href=\"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">CC BY-NC-SA 4.0</a>. Formatting adapted for this noncommercial local study app."
