    "prompt": "A vector field E → (not necessarily an electric field; note units) is given by E → = 3 x 2 k ^ . Calculate ∫ S E → · n ^ d a , where S is the area shown below. Assume that n ^ = k ^ .",
    "previewHTML": "<p>A vector field <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mstyle mathvariant=\"bold\"><mover accent=\"true\"><mtext>E</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">→</mo></mover></mstyle></mrow></semantics></math></span> (not necessarily an electric field; note units) is given by <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mstyle mathvariant=\"bold\"><mover accent=\"true\"><mtext>E</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">→</mo></mover></mstyle><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mstyle mathvariant=\"bold\"><mover accent=\"true\"><mtext>k</mtext><mo>^</mo></mover></mstyle><mo>.</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> Calculate <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mstyle><mrow><msub><mo>∫</mo><mi>S</mi></msub><mrow><mstyle mathvariant=\"bold\"><mover accent=\"true\"><mtext>E</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">→</mo></mover></mstyle><mo>·</mo><mstyle mathvariant=\"bold\"><mover accent=\"true\"><mtext>n</mtext><mo>^</mo></mover></mstyle><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mi>d</mi><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo></mrow></mrow></mstyle></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> where <em>S</em> is the area shown below. Assume that <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mstyle mathvariant=\"bold\"><mover accent=\"true\"><mtext>n</mtext><mo>^</mo></mover></mstyle><mo>=</mo><mstyle mathvariant=\"bold\"><mover accent=\"true\"><mtext>k</mtext><mo>^</mo></mover></mstyle><mo>.</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span></p>",
    "statementHTML": "<div>\n<p>A vector field <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mstyle mathvariant=\"bold\"><mover accent=\"true\"><mtext>E</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">→</mo></mover></mstyle></mrow></semantics></math></span> (not necessarily an electric field; note units) is given by <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mstyle mathvariant=\"bold\"><mover accent=\"true\"><mtext>E</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">→</mo></mover></mstyle><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mstyle mathvariant=\"bold\"><mover accent=\"true\"><mtext>k</mtext><mo>^</mo></mover></mstyle><mo>.</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> Calculate <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mstyle><mrow><msub><mo>∫</mo><mi>S</mi></msub><mrow><mstyle mathvariant=\"bold\"><mover accent=\"true\"><mtext>E</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">→</mo></mover></mstyle><mo>·</mo><mstyle mathvariant=\"bold\"><mover accent=\"true\"><mtext>n</mtext><mo>^</mo></mover></mstyle><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mi>d</mi><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo></mrow></mrow></mstyle></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> where <em>S</em> is the area shown below. Assume that <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mstyle mathvariant=\"bold\"><mover accent=\"true\"><mtext>n</mtext><mo>^</mo></mover></mstyle><mo>=</mo><mstyle mathvariant=\"bold\"><mover accent=\"true\"><mtext>k</mtext><mo>^</mo></mover></mstyle><mo>.</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span></p>\n<span>\n<img alt=\"A square S with length of each side equal to a is shown in the xy plane.\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://openstax.org/apps/archive/20260604.144757/resources/eafc02623ee2a3ab438a1516719c862b1375cdc7\"/>\n</span>\n</div>",
    "url": "https://openstax.org/books/university-physics-volume-2/pages/6-additional-problems#fs-id1172100667514",
    "attributionHTML": "OpenStax, <em>University Physics Volume 2</em>, Chapter 6, Problem 72. Authors: William Moebs, Samuel J. Ling, and Jeff Sanny. <a href=\"https://openstax.org/books/university-physics-volume-2/pages/6-additional-problems#fs-id1172100667514\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Access for free at OpenStax</a>. Content © Rice University, licensed <a href=\"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">CC BY-NC-SA 4.0</a>. Formatting adapted for this noncommercial local study app."
