    "category": "additional-problems",
    "topic": "Sources of magnetic fields",
    "prompt": "Three long, straight, parallel wires, all carrying 20 A, are positioned as shown in the accompanying figure. What is the magnitude of the magnetic field at the point P ?",
    "previewHTML": "<p>Three long, straight, parallel wires, all carrying 20 A, are positioned as shown in the accompanying figure. What is the magnitude of the magnetic field at the point <em>P</em>?</p>",
    "statementHTML": "<div>\n<p>Three long, straight, parallel wires, all carrying 20 A, are positioned as shown in the accompanying figure. What is the magnitude of the magnetic field at the point <em>P</em>?</p>\n<span>\n<img alt=\"This figure shows three long, straight, parallel wires. Each wire forms a vertex of an equilateral triangle with 10 centimeter sides. Point P is the center of a triangle.\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://openstax.org/apps/archive/20260604.144757/resources/d5d1dfab6f34efab3606df452c8864f1b73afda2\"/>\n</span>\n</div>",
