    "topic": "Friction",
    "prompt": "(a) When rebuilding an engine, a physics major must exert 3.00 × 10 2 N of force to insert a dry steel piston into a steel cylinder. What is the normal force between the piston and…",
    "previewHTML": "<p>(a) When rebuilding an engine, a physics major must exert <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>3.00</mn><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mo>×</mo><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> N of force to insert a dry steel piston into a steel cylinder. What is the normal force between the piston and cylinder? (b) What force would they have to exert if the steel parts were oiled?</p>",
    "statementHTML": "<div>\n<p>(a) When rebuilding an engine, a physics major must exert <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>3.00</mn><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mo>×</mo><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> N of force to insert a dry steel piston into a steel cylinder. What is the normal force between the piston and cylinder? (b) What force would they have to exert if the steel parts were oiled?</p>\n</div>",
