    "statementHTML": "<div>\n<p>A circular area <em>S</em> is concentric with the origin, has radius <em>a</em>, and lies in the <em>yz</em>-plane. Calculate <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mstyle><mrow><msub><mo>∫</mo><mi>S</mi></msub><mrow><mstyle mathvariant=\"bold\"><mover accent=\"true\"><mtext>E</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">→</mo></mover></mstyle><mo>·</mo><mstyle mathvariant=\"bold\"><mover accent=\"true\"><mtext>n</mtext><mo>^</mo></mover></mstyle><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mi>d</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow></mrow></mstyle></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> for <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mstyle mathvariant=\"bold\"><mover accent=\"true\"><mtext>E</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">→</mo></mover></mstyle><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mstyle mathvariant=\"bold\"><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mstyle><mo>.</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span></p>\n</div>",
