    "topic": "Friction",
    "prompt": "At a post office, a parcel that is a 20.0-kg box slides down a ramp inclined at 30.0 ° with the horizontal. The coefficient of kinetic friction between the box and plane is 0.0300. (a)…",
    "previewHTML": "<p>At a post office, a parcel that is a 20.0-kg box slides down a ramp inclined at <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>30.0</mn><mtext>°</mtext></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> with the horizontal. The coefficient of kinetic friction between the box and plane is 0.0300. (a) Find the acceleration of the box. (b) Find the velocity of the box as it reaches the end of the plane, if the length of the plane is 2 m and the box starts at rest.</p>",
    "statementHTML": "<div>\n<p>At a post office, a parcel that is a 20.0-kg box slides down a ramp inclined at <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>30.0</mn><mtext>°</mtext></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> with the horizontal. The coefficient of kinetic friction between the box and plane is 0.0300. (a) Find the acceleration of the box. (b) Find the velocity of the box as it reaches the end of the plane, if the length of the plane is 2 m and the box starts at rest.</p>\n</div>",
    "url": "https://openstax.org/books/university-physics-volume-1/pages/6-problems#fs-id1165034581253",
    "attributionHTML": "OpenStax, <em>University Physics Volume 1</em>, Chapter 6, Problem 64. Authors: William Moebs, Samuel J. Ling, and Jeff Sanny. <a href=\"https://openstax.org/books/university-physics-volume-1/pages/6-problems#fs-id1165034581253\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Access for free at OpenStax</a>. Content © Rice University, licensed <a href=\"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">CC BY-NC-SA 4.0</a>. Formatting adapted for this noncommercial local study app."
