    "prompt": "A particle travels in a circular orbit of radius 10 m. Its speed is changing at a rate of 15.0 m / s 2 at an instant when its speed is 40.0 m/s. What is the magnitude of the acceleration…",
    "previewHTML": "<p>A particle travels in a circular orbit of radius 10 m. Its speed is changing at a rate of <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>15.0</mn><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mrow><mtext>m</mtext><mtext>/</mtext><mrow><msup><mtext>s</mtext><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> at an instant when its speed is 40.0 m/s. What is the magnitude of the acceleration of the particle?</p>",
