    "prompt": "(a) A 22.0-kg child is riding a playground merry-go-round that is rotating at 40.0 rev/min. What centripetal force is exerted if he is 1.25 m from its center? (b) What centripetal force…",
    "previewHTML": "<p>(a) A 22.0-kg child is riding a playground merry-go-round that is rotating at 40.0 rev/min. What centripetal force is exerted if he is 1.25 m from its center? (b) What centripetal force is exerted if the merry-go-round rotates at 3.00 rev/min and he is 8.00 m from its center? (c) Compare each force with his weight.</p>",
    "statementHTML": "<div>\n<p>(a) A 22.0-kg child is riding a playground merry-go-round that is rotating at 40.0 rev/min. What centripetal force is exerted if he is 1.25 m from its center? (b) What centripetal force is exerted if the merry-go-round rotates at 3.00 rev/min and he is 8.00 m from its center? (c) Compare each force with his weight.</p>\n</div>",
    "url": "https://openstax.org/books/university-physics-volume-1/pages/6-problems#fs-id1165039087650",
    "solutionUrl": "https://openstax.org/books/university-physics-volume-1/pages/chapter-6#fs-id1165039087650-solution",
    "solutionHTML": "<div>\n<p>a. 483 N; b. 17.4 N; c. 2.24, 0.0807</p>\n</div>",
