    "category": "additional-problems",
    "topic": "Motion in two dimensions",
    "prompt": "A long jumper can jump a distance of 8.0 m when he takes off at an angle of 45 ° with respect to the horizontal. Assuming he can jump with the same initial speed at all angles, how much…",
    "previewHTML": "<p>A long jumper can jump a distance of 8.0 m when he takes off at an angle of <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>45</mn><mtext>°</mtext></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> with respect to the horizontal. Assuming he can jump with the same initial speed at all angles, how much distance does he lose by taking off at <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>30</mn><mtext>°</mtext><mo>?</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span></p>",
    "statementHTML": "<div>\n<p>A long jumper can jump a distance of 8.0 m when he takes off at an angle of <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>45</mn><mtext>°</mtext></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span> with respect to the horizontal. Assuming he can jump with the same initial speed at all angles, how much distance does he lose by taking off at <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>30</mn><mtext>°</mtext><mo>?</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span></p>\n</div>",
    "url": "https://openstax.org/books/university-physics-volume-1/pages/4-additional-problems#fs-id1165039312347",
    "solutionUrl": "https://openstax.org/books/university-physics-volume-1/pages/chapter-4#fs-id1165039312347-solution",
    "solutionHTML": "<div>\n<p>\n<span><math display=\"inline\">\n<semantics>\n<mrow>\n<mrow>\n<mi>R</mi>\n<mo>=</mo>\n<mn>1.07</mn>\n<mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace>\n<mtext>m</mtext>\n</mrow>\n</mrow>\n\n</semantics>\n</math></span>\n</p>\n</div>",
    "attributionHTML": "OpenStax, <em>University Physics Volume 1</em>, Chapter 4, Problem 93. Authors: William Moebs, Samuel J. Ling, and Jeff Sanny. <a href=\"https://openstax.org/books/university-physics-volume-1/pages/4-additional-problems#fs-id1165039312347\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Access for free at OpenStax</a>. Content © Rice University, licensed <a href=\"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">CC BY-NC-SA 4.0</a>. Formatting adapted for this noncommercial local study app."
