    "prompt": "A geosynchronous satellite orbits Earth at a distance of 42,250.0 km and has a period of 1 day. What is the centripetal acceleration of the satellite?",
    "previewHTML": "<p>A geosynchronous satellite orbits Earth at a distance of 42,250.0 km and has a period of 1 day. What is the centripetal acceleration of the satellite?</p>",
    "statementHTML": "<div>\n<p>A geosynchronous satellite orbits Earth at a distance of 42,250.0 km and has a period of 1 day. What is the centripetal acceleration of the satellite?</p>\n</div>",
    "url": "https://openstax.org/books/university-physics-volume-1/pages/4-additional-problems#fs-id1165039244714",
