    "prompt": "A 30.0-g ball at the end of a string is swung in a vertical circle with a radius of 25.0 cm. The tangential velocity is 200.0 cm/s. Find the tension in the string: (a) at the top of the…",
    "previewHTML": "<p>A 30.0-g ball at the end of a string is swung in a vertical circle with a radius of 25.0 cm. The tangential velocity is 200.0 cm/s. Find the tension in the string: (a) at the top of the circle, (b) at the bottom of the circle, and (c) at a distance of 12.5 cm from the center of the circle <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>12.5</mn><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mtext>cm</mtext></mrow><mo>)</mo><mo>.</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span></p>",
    "statementHTML": "<div>\n<p>A 30.0-g ball at the end of a string is swung in a vertical circle with a radius of 25.0 cm. The tangential velocity is 200.0 cm/s. Find the tension in the string: (a) at the top of the circle, (b) at the bottom of the circle, and (c) at a distance of 12.5 cm from the center of the circle <span><math display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>12.5</mn><mspace width=\"0.2em\"></mspace><mtext>cm</mtext></mrow><mo>)</mo><mo>.</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></span></p></div>",
    "url": "https://openstax.org/books/university-physics-volume-1/pages/6-additional-problems#fs-id1165039446792",
    "solutionUrl": "https://openstax.org/books/university-physics-volume-1/pages/chapter-6#fs-id1165039446792-solution",
    "solutionHTML": "<div>\n<p>a. 0.186 N; b. 0.774 N; c. 0.48 N</p></div>",
    "attributionHTML": "OpenStax, <em>University Physics Volume 1</em>, Chapter 6, Problem 115. Authors: William Moebs, Samuel J. Ling, and Jeff Sanny. <a href=\"https://openstax.org/books/university-physics-volume-1/pages/6-additional-problems#fs-id1165039446792\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Access for free at OpenStax</a>. Content © Rice University, licensed <a href=\"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">CC BY-NC-SA 4.0</a>. Formatting adapted for this noncommercial local study app."
