    "prompt": "The mass of a particle is 15 kg. (a) What is its weight on Earth? (b) What is its weight on the Moon? (c) What is its mass on the Moon? (d) What is its weight in outer space far from any…",
    "previewHTML": "<p>The mass of a particle is 15 kg. (a) What is its weight on Earth? (b) What is its weight on the Moon? (c) What is its mass on the Moon? (d) What is its weight in outer space far from any celestial body? (e) What is its mass at this point?</p>",
    "statementHTML": "<div>\n<p>The mass of a particle is 15 kg. (a) What is its weight on Earth? (b) What is its weight on the Moon? (c) What is its mass on the Moon? (d) What is its weight in outer space far from any celestial body? (e) What is its mass at this point?</p>\n</div>",
    "url": "https://openstax.org/books/university-physics-volume-1/pages/13-problems#fs-id1168325680813",
    "solutionUrl": "https://openstax.org/books/university-physics-volume-1/pages/chapter-13#fs-id1168325680813-solution",
    "solutionHTML": "<div>\n<p>a. 147 N; b. 25.5 N; c. 15 kg; d. 0; e. 15 kg</p>\n</div>",
    "attributionHTML": "OpenStax, <em>University Physics Volume 1</em>, Chapter 13, Problem 23. Authors: William Moebs, Samuel J. Ling, and Jeff Sanny. <a href=\"https://openstax.org/books/university-physics-volume-1/pages/13-problems#fs-id1168325680813\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Access for free at OpenStax</a>. Content © Rice University, licensed <a href=\"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">CC BY-NC-SA 4.0</a>. Formatting adapted for this noncommercial local study app."
