    "topic": "Gravitation and orbits",
    "prompt": "Calculate the values of g at Earth’s surface for the following changes in Earth’s properties: (a) its mass is doubled and its radius is halved; (b) its mass density is doubled and its…",
    "previewHTML": "<p>Calculate the values of <em>g</em> at Earth’s surface for the following changes in Earth’s properties: (a) its mass is doubled and its radius is halved; (b) its mass density is doubled and its radius is unchanged; (c) its mass density is halved and its mass is unchanged.</p>",
    "statementHTML": "<div>\n<p>Calculate the values of <em>g</em> at Earth’s surface for the following changes in Earth’s properties: (a) its mass is doubled and its radius is halved; (b) its mass density is doubled and its radius is unchanged; (c) its mass density is halved and its mass is unchanged.</p>\n</div>",
