    "prompt": "An asteroid has speed 15.5 km/s when it is located 2.00 AU from the sun. At its closest approach, it is 0.400 AU from the Sun. What is its speed at that point?",
    "previewHTML": "<p>An asteroid has speed 15.5 km/s when it is located 2.00 AU from the sun. At its closest approach, it is 0.400 AU from the Sun. What is its speed at that point?</p>",
    "statementHTML": "<div>\n<p>An asteroid has speed 15.5 km/s when it is located 2.00 AU from the sun. At its closest approach, it is 0.400 AU from the Sun. What is its speed at that point?</p>\n</div>",
    "url": "https://openstax.org/books/university-physics-volume-1/pages/13-additional-problems#fs-id1168328277302",
